node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_reporting_extension.mjs|reporting%20fixture%20publishes%20one%20complete%20EOF-terminated%20Unicode%20frame%20before%20interruption|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Extension tests,node-test,tests/pi_reporting_extension.mjs,node,integration,reporting fixture publishes one complete EOF-terminated Unicode frame before interruption,default,tests/pi_reporting_extension.mjs,445,459,"[""src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:69-170"", ""src/ovrcr-reporting-transport.mjs:1-160""]","A helper child is killed at its own interruption point after writing one JSON body: the record ends with a newline, parses as exactly one frame, and preserves a literal backslash path, unicode text and an escaped newline.","If the fixture helper wrote the frame without a trailing newline or in two partial writes, a killed helper would leave an unterminated line and the next JSON body would be unparseable, so frame-record assertions would silently break.",1,4,1,1,25,55,43,The subject is the test fixture's helper protocol; a regression corrupts other suites' evidence rather than any product path (tests/pi_reporting_extension.mjs:64-71).,"It asserts newline termination, single-frame parseability and exact payload equality after a SIGKILL at the writer's own checkpoint (tests/pi_reporting_extension.mjs:445-459), which is decisive for the fixture protocol.","No other test asserts the fixture helper's frame framing or its unicode/escape round-trip; the handler it drives is tests/fixtures/pi/pi_host.mjs:177-180, which no other reviewed case exercises.",This is a plumbing check of the fixture's own stub helper: the assertion never touches the extension or the transport (tests/pi_reporting_extension.mjs:446-448).,high,keep,"Fixture-protocol qualification at F=1; usefulness 55 exceeds the prune floor and no product gate applies, so it stays as grounded infrastructure coverage.",[],0.030s reported for this case; ordinary node:test case in the 'Extension tests' batch,0.030,0.030,1,0,hosted-single-run,TAP duration_ms 30.379 at macOS-job.log:4323; run 42429838269 job 128576086691 step 'Extension tests',extensions-installed-pi-002,
