nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Api_delegation|control_proxy_closed_peer_does_not_prevent_the_next_valid_frame|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::pi_delegation,integration,integration,control_proxy_closed_peer_does_not_prevent_the_next_valid_frame,default,tests/pi_delegation.rs,1122,1153,"[""src/cli/delegation_publisher.rs:138-160"", ""crates/ovrcr-protocol/src/lib.rs:1-1""]","Exercises the test control-proxy stream setup on macOS: a positively closed peer reports no frame, a queued complete frame survives peer close, and the frame stays readable before EOF, covering the EINVAL-after-close path with recv MSG_PEEK and poll fallback.","A control-proxy stream setup that treats a closed peer as an error and aborts routing, or that discards an already-queued complete frame after the peer closes on macOS.",1,3,2,2,25,60,46,"Failure affects only the test fault proxy's stream classification; the production publisher merely sets a read timeout without this close classification (src/cli/delegation_publisher.rs:138-160), so consequence is test-infrastructure only.","Exact branch assertions distinguish no-frame, buffered-complete-frame, and post-frame EOF, rejecting both false continue and false abort outcomes; assertion at tests/pi_delegation.rs:1142-1145.","Distinct macOS-specific boundary from the malformed-frame test, but its queued-frame assertion is repeated in that sibling test; compared with nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Api_delegation|control_proxy_preserves_queued_frames_and_rejects_incomplete_or_invalid_requests|default at tests/pi_delegation.rs:1156-1189; distinguishing assertion at tests/pi_delegation.rs:1142-1145.","Harness helper configure_proxy_stream plus production read_frame is exercised, not the production publisher forward loop; the helper is a test-only stand-in; real boundary at tests/pi_delegation.rs:1059-1120.",medium,keep,Grounded harness-platform coverage guarding a macOS-specific false failure mode; fidelity is limited but the boundary is real and cheap.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Api_delegation|control_proxy_preserves_queued_frames_and_rejects_incomplete_or_invalid_requests|default""]","[""cfg(target_os = \""macos\"") only"", ""UnixStream::pair"", ""libc recv MSG_PEEK and poll"", ""eprintln diagnostic on timeout setup failure""]",0.018,0.018,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1095 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-delegation-001,
