nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclient_startup|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::client_startup,integration,unit,live::command_clears_inherited_reporting_authority,default,tests/support/live.rs,568,579,"[""tests/support/live.rs:163-196"", ""tests/support/live.rs:111-149"", ""src/report.rs:76-95"", ""src/cli/agent.rs:106-126""]","The shared `Live` fixture builds every fixture child with Command::env_remove for OVRCR_HOOK_SOCKET, OVRCR_HOOK_TOKEN and OVRCR_SESSION_ID; the test asserts that the Command returned by Live::command() carries each of those three names with a None value, i.e. the removal is present in the exact builder that every test binary spawns.","If one env_remove were dropped, a fixture `ovrcr` child would inherit the developer/CI hook identity: report::HookIdentity::from_environment (src/report.rs:76-95) would send lifecycle reports to that foreign hook socket as that foreign session, and `agent run` would mint OVRCR_DELEGATION_* capability env from it (src/cli/agent.rs:106-126), so fixture agents would report into another instance's session instead of the fixture's own server.",2,3,0,3,50,45,47,"No shipped path is under test, so the blast radius is test infrastructure; the consequence is bounded to test runs and recoverable by clearing the environment, yet a regression silently writes into a developer instance's session through src/report.rs:76-95 and src/cli/agent.rs:106-126, which is why it is above a cosmetic detail.","Three exact positive/negative assertions on Command::get_envs (tests/support/live.rs:570-578) reject the precise defect of a dropped env_remove or a re-added value; they would not catch a later override re-adding the variables in a per-test builder, and nothing spawns the command to read the child's effective environ (that end-to-end form exists only for the shipped runner at tests/cli.rs:2349-2362).","Fully subsumed: the body at tests/support/live.rs:568-579 is the single definition included via #[path = ""support/live.rs""] by every suite (e.g. tests/automatic_titles.rs:1-2, tests/tui/main.rs:5-6); the ovrcr::client_startup target changes only which other tests share the binary, never the Command env map, so the assertions and their reach are identical to the representative's",Live::command() is the builder every fixture child is spawned from (tests/support/live.rs:163-196) and the asserted Command env map is the map std propagates to the child; the limit is that the test inspects the builder rather than a spawned child's /proc environ.,high,consolidate,"Repeated execution of an identical body: the assertions and the call path (Live::idle -> Live::command, tests/support/live.rs:111-196) are byte-identical to the retained representative nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aautomatic_titles|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default, and nothing in the ovrcr::client_startup binary alters the env removals or the assertions; execution count drops from 28 to 1 with the isolation invariant still asserted","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aautomatic_titles|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclaude_quota_probe|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclaude_reporting_load|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acli|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclient_startup_server|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acodex_initial_prompt|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acursor_cloud|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Agit_lifecycle|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Ainitial_prompt|live%3A%3A