-579 is the single definition included via #[path = ""support/live.rs""] by every suite (e.g. tests/automatic_titles.rs:1-2, tests/tui/main.rs:5-6); the ovrcr::cursor_cloud target changes only which other tests share the binary, never the Command env map, so the assertions and their reach are identical to the representative's",Live::command() is the builder every fixture child is spawned from (tests/support/live.rs:163-196) and the asserted Command env map is the map std propagates to the child; the limit is that the test inspects the builder rather than a spawned child's /proc environ.,high,consolidate,"Repeated execution of an identical body: the assertions and the call path (Live::idle -> Live::command, tests/support/live.rs:111-196) are byte-identical to the retained representative nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aautomatic_titles|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default, and nothing in the ovrcr::cursor_cloud binary alters the env removals or the assertions; execution count drops from 28 to 1 with the isolation invariant still asserted","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aautomatic_titles|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclaude_quota_probe|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclaude_reporting_load|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acli|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclient_startup|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclient_startup_server|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acodex_initial_prompt|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Agit_lifecycle|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Ainitial_prompt|live%3A%3Acomman