 definition included via #[path = ""support/live.rs""] by every suite (e.g. tests/automatic_titles.rs:1-2, tests/tui/main.rs:5-6); the ovrcr::tui target changes only which other tests share the binary, never the Command env map, so the assertions and their reach are identical to the representative's",Live::command() is the builder every fixture child is spawned from (tests/support/live.rs:163-196) and the asserted Command env map is the map std propagates to the child; the limit is that the test inspects the builder rather than a spawned child's /proc environ.,high,consolidate,"Repeated execution of an identical body: the assertions and the call path (Live::idle -> Live::command, tests/support/live.rs:111-196) are byte-identical to the retained representative nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aautomatic_titles|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default, and nothing in the ovrcr::tui binary alters the env removals or the assertions; execution count drops from 28 to 1 with the isolation invariant still asserted","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aautomatic_titles|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclaude_quota_probe|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclaude_reporting_load|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acli|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclient_startup|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclient_startup_server|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acodex_initial_prompt|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acursor_cloud|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Agit_lifecycle|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Ainitial_prompt|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aoperator_e2e|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aoperator_scope|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Api_delegation|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Api_package|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aprovider_quota|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aquota_ui_option_a_smoke|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aregistry_migration|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aresource_cli|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aretained_capacity|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aretained_ownership|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aretained_sessions|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Asettings_lifecycle|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atask_execution|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aterminal_acceptance|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Awip_save|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aworkspace_identity|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default""]","0.294s first attempt, one hosted atte