ble|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|agent_attention%3A%3Aattention_compact_retained_unread_without_reporter_is_unavailable|default""]",Two full TestBackend renders at 120x40 and 24x9,0.035,0.035,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1729 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,
