nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|agent_search%3A%3Acommand_shortcut_cancels_control_hold_without_navigating|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,agent_search::command_shortcut_cancels_control_hold_without_navigating,default,tests/tui/agent_search.rs,402,432,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:1140-1215"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:1103-1127""]","Cmd-Backspace during a live Control hold cancels the hold, hides every label, keeps the focused session, shows 'Session jump cancelled', and falls through to ordinary dispatch.","The Command shortcut consumed by the hold (host shortcut dead) or treated as cancel-with-navigation, moving the selection.",2,3,1,3,50,55,53,Bounded to one host shortcut during a transient gesture; releasing Control is a workaround (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:1181-1210).,"Asserts DashboardAction::None, unchanged focus, labels gone and the exact footer after the Super-Backspace event (tests/tui/agent_search.rs:402-432).","session_jump_single_digit::cmd_backspace_cancels_without_navigation_or_child_input asserts the same cancel, same footer, hidden labels and empty outbox for the same Super-Backspace key (tests/tui/session_jump_single_digit.rs:107-162).",Real event dispatch through the shared gesture and keymap; no stand-in for the modifier routing (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:1140-1215).,high,keep,"session_jump_single_digit::cmd_backspace_cancels_without_navigation_or_child_input drives the same key, but never asserts the returned DashboardAction, so it would not catch a cancelled hold that skips the redraw; keep this real-key integration row (tests/tui/agent_search.rs:402-432).","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|session_jump_single_digit%3A%3Acmd_backspace_cancels_without_navigation_or_child_input|default""]",Two sidebar renders plus one footer render,0.028,0.028,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1752 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|agent_search%3A%3Actrl_g_cancels_a_live_hold_and_keeps_dashboard_handling|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,agent_search::ctrl_g_cancels_a_live_hold_and_keeps_dashboard_handling,default,tests/tui/agent_search.rs,538,569,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:1181-1215"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/keymap.rs:231-247""]","Ctrl-g during a hold keeps ordinary Browse dispatch: the chord is not consumed by the gesture, and a following ':' opens the Command palette.",The hold swallowing Ctrl-g so the dashboard's double-key palette chord is dead until Control is released.,2,2,2,3,50,55,53,Bounded: a global chord is temporarily unavailable during a gesture (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:1181-1215).,"Asserts DashboardAction::None for Ctrl-g, then that ':' returns Redraw and the palette text contains 'Command palette'; it does not assert the labels were hidden or the outbox empty (tests/tui/agent_search.rs:538-569).","Same cancel-without-navigation family as the Command and Ctrl-o tests, but a distinct chord and the only test that drives ':' after a hold (tests/tui/agent_search.rs:402-432).",Real event dispatch and palette rendering; the chord handoff is the subject (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:1181-1215).,high,keep,"Covers the Ctrl-g plus palette handoff, which no other test drives.","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|agent_search%3A%3Actrl_o_keeps_its_operator_quick_message_path_during_control_hold|default""]",Two renders at 120x40,0.054,0.054,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1758 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|agent_search%3A%3Actrl_o_keeps_its_operator_quick_message_path_during_control_hold|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,agent_search::ctrl_o_keeps_its_operator_quick_message_path_during_control_hold,default,tests/tui/agent_search.rs,517,535,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:1181-1210"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/keymap.rs:466-470""]",Ctrl-o during a live hold still opens the Operator quick message and the hold labels disappear.,"The hold eating Ctrl-o, making the operator quick message unreachable while Control is down, or the overlay leaving jump labels visible.",2,2,2,3,50,55,53,Bounded: one global shortcut is unreachable during a transient gesture (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:1181-1210).,Checks that the rendered screen contains 'Quick message' and no '[1]'; there is no focus or outbox assertion (tests/tui/agent_search.rs:517-535).,Different key path from the Ctrl-g and Command cases; it is the only test of the operator overlay under a hold (tests/tui/agent_search.rs:538-569).,"Real key dispatch, operator overlay and render on a TestBackend; the overlay is the subject (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:1181-1210).",high,keep,"Protects the Ctrl-o reservation during the hold, which no sibling test covers.","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|agent_search%3A%3Actrl_g_cancels_a_live_hold_and_keeps_dashboard_handling|default""]",Two full 120x40 renders,0.033,0.033,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1759 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|cards%3A%3Aan_80_column_window_keeps_each_row_state_and_age_in_its_40_column_pane|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,cards::an_80_column_window_keeps_each_row_state_and_age_in_its_40_column_pane,default,tests/tui/cards.rs,245,291,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:332-443"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:619-645""]","At 80x24 each 40-column card row keeps its state and age ('Working · 0m', 'Ready · unread reply · 0m') and the project row keeps '2 sessions · ? 1 · ✓ 1', with the long title ellipsized.","Elapsed/state or the attention counts clipped off when the pane is 40 columns, or the long title not shortened.",2,3,1,3,50,55,53,Bounded narrow-layout failure: the information remains reachable by widening the window (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:332-443).,"Exact row suffixes for busy, unread-ready and project-attention rows plus the ellipsis (tests/tui/cards.rs:245-291).","dashboard::cards::tests::a_narrow_pane_keeps_state_and_elapsed_and_shortens_the_rest, a_narrow_unread_row_keeps_its_whole_state_and_age and a_narrow_project_row_keeps_both_attention_counts assert the same suffixes in a 40-column Room; only the real 80-column pane layout is added (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:1058-1134).",Real pane rects and card renderer at 80x24; the 40-column Room is the same subject the unit tests use (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:1058-1134).,high,keep,"The narrow-card unit tests assert the same suffixes from a 40-column Room object; this row additionally proves the suffix survives real 40-column pane layout in an 80x24 window, so removal loses that configuration boundary (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:1058-1134).","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-tui|dashboard%3A%3Acards%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aa_narrow_pane_keeps_state_and_elapsed_and_shortens_the_rest|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr-tui|dashboard%3A%3Acards%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aa_narrow_unread_row_keeps_its_whole_state_and_age|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr-tui|dashboard%3A%3Acards%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aa_narrow_project_row_keeps_both_attention_counts|default""]",Three full 80x24 renders,0.035,0.035,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1771 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|cards%3A%3Aclicking_a_project_row_shows_its_card|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,cards::clicking_a_project_row_shows_its_card,default,tests/tui/cards.rs,133,154,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:56-84"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:149-247""]","Clicking a project row in the sidebar shows that project's card, leading with the first-agent suggestion and listing its workspace count and hints.","The click mapping selecting a different row or leaving the pane blank, or the project card showing another project.",2,2,2,3,50,55,53,Bounded click-target UX; the keyboard path remains (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:56-84).,"Asserts the header, the first line, one workspace count line and one hint, with the row located from the rendered screen (tests/tui/cards.rs:133-154).",Sidebar click-mapping tests and the unit project-card test cover the halves; this joins them (tests/tui/sidebar.rs:730-785).,Real mouse dispatch and renderer; the click column is fixed and the row is read from the buffer (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:56-84).,medium,keep,Project-row click to card is only joined here; the mouse handler itself was not read line by line.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|sidebar%3A%3Asidebar_clicks_map_one_line_per_session_and_skip_gap_lines|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr-tui|dashboard%3A%3Acards%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aproject_card_counts_sessions_and_attention_per_workspace|default""]",One full 120x40 render and one click,0.039,0.039,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1774 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|cards%3A%3Amoving_through_the_tree_shows_a_card_instead_of_a_blank_pane|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,cards::moving_through_the_tree_shows_a_card_instead_of_a_blank_pane,default,tests/tui/cards.rs,47,98,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:85-148"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:149-331""]","Navigating with k from a session to its workspace and project shows the workspace card (path, sessions, hints) and the project card (workspace counts, hints), and the promised j opens the local shell.","A container selection leaving a blank pane, a card listing sessions in the wrong order, or a hint promising a key that does nothing.",2,3,1,3,50,55,53,Bounded UX: the pane is temporarily empty and the user can move back; no state is lost (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:85-148).,"Asserts the exact leading card lines, all four hints, the project card's ten lines, and the real j action selecting the shell (tests/tui/cards.rs:47-98).","dashboard::cards::tests::workspace_card_lists_sessions_in_sidebar_order_and_what_to_do_next, the_open_hint_names_what_the_next_row_key_selects and project_card_counts_sessions_and_attention_per_workspace assert the same card lines and the same j key; only the k-driven container transition differs (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:848-919,955-989).",Real tree navigation and real card renderer; fixtures provide the hierarchy (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:248-331).,high,keep,"The card unit tests select a container directly and render the card; they do not navigate with k from a session to workspace to project, so removal would leave the real transition path unprotected. Overlap is partial (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/cards.rs:848-919).","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-tui|dashboard%3A%3Acards%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aworkspace_card_lists_sessions_in_sidebar_order_and_what_to_do_next|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr-tui|dashboard%3A%3Acards%3A%3Atests%3A%3Athe_open_hint_names_what_the_next_row_key_selects|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr-tui|dashboard%3A%3Acards%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aproject_card_counts_sessions_and_attention_per_workspace|default""]",Three full 120x40 renders and one view pump,0.106,0.106,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1782 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|copy_history%3A%3Abrowse_and_terminal_modes_keep_input_ownership_clear|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,copy_history::browse_and_terminal_modes_keep_input_ownership_clear,default,tests/tui/copy_history.rs,294,305,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/keymap.rs:232-260""]","q detaches in Browse; after Enter, q is a PTY byte, Ctrl-g leaves Terminal for Browse, and q detaches again.","q sent to the program when the user meant to detach, or detach swallowed in Terminal mode.",2,2,2,3,50,55,53,"Bounded: the user can leave either way, but a misrouted q can act in their program (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/keymap.rs:380-420).",Four exact DashboardActions on a happy path (tests/tui/copy_history.rs:294-305).,Keymap uniqueness and mode tests cover binding ownership; this direct dispatch check is small but distinct (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/keymap.rs:232-260).,Real key dispatch and mode transitions; no child process is involved in the claim (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/keymap.rs:232-260).,high,keep,A compact but real check of detach versus terminal input.,[],Two dashboards and three key dispatches,0.017,0.017,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1781 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|copy_history%3A%3Acopy_render_tiny_pane_and_footer|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,copy_history::copy_render_tiny_pane_and_footer,default,tests/tui/copy_history.rs,516,577,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/hints.rs:6-60"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:2222-2270""]","A 1x1 terminal draws the dashboard without panicking; the COPY footer lists its keys; the frozen screen keeps a/b/c at their cells and ignores later live output; an Error response replaces the footer, and an unready entry shows 'Waiting for terminal screen'.","A panic on a degenerate terminal, a copy footer missing its keys, or an error/unready state not surfaced in the footer.",2,2,2,3,50,55,53,"Bounded: a panic on a tiny terminal would end the dashboard, but the rest is footer/visual state (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/hints.rs:6-60).",Footer string and cell checks plus a no-panic draw; some assertions are broad presence checks (tests/tui/copy_history.rs:516-577).,Overlaps the copy-mode test and sidebar's tiny-geometry draw test (tests/tui/sidebar.rs:1206-1229).,Real renderer at degenerate and normal sizes with real copy state (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/hints.rs:6-60).,medium,keep,Covers the 1x1 draw and footer/error surface; the footer assembly was only partly read.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|copy_history%3A%3Acopy_mode_routes_keys_and_freezes_output|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|sidebar%3A%3Adashboard_geometry_remains_drawable_at_target_and_tiny_sizes|default""]",Three renders including a 1x1 TestBackend,0.063,0.063,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1792 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,
