nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|mouse%3A%3Aleaving_the_sidebar_still_forwards_pane_motion|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,mouse::leaving_the_sidebar_still_forwards_pane_motion,default,tests/tui/mouse.rs,310,332,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:3261-3360"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:3413-3525""]",A Moved event over the sidebar then enabling any-motion tracking: a Moved event inside the pane is forwarded as PtyBytes and the sidebar row no longer shows a hover marker.,"Sidebar hover state swallowing the first pane motion event, or leaving a stale hover marker painted over the sidebar.",2,2,2,3,50,55,53,A swallowed/misplaced motion event is a bounded interaction defect.,Asserts PtyBytes forwarding plus a negative render check for the sidebar marker.,Hover-to-pane motion handoff is a distinct boundary from the pure encoding tests.,Real Dashboard with real sidebar/pane geometry and render.,high,keep,Protects the sidebar-hover-to-pane transition.,[],"[""TestBackend 120x40 render""]",0.056,0.056,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1835 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-002,
