nextest|Test|ovrcr|report%3A%3Acodex%3A%3Atests%3A%3Anon_resumable_reporting_identity_still_produces_ready|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr,lib,unit,report::codex::tests::non_resumable_reporting_identity_still_produces_ready,default,src/report/codex.rs,1235,1260,"[""src/report/codex.rs:431-470""]","With no resumable conversation id, a prompt then Stop still publishes ResponseReady as the last state.","Dropping Ready when the conversation is not resumable, so the Dashboard never marks the turn finished.",2,2,2,4,50,60,56,"A missing ResponseReady sample leaves the Dashboard stale for one turn while the terminal output and the completed turn remain inspectable, so the failure is bounded (src/report/codex.rs:431-470); C=2 rather than 3. The S=2 limit stands: only the last activity after one prompt/stop pair is asserted at src/report/codex.rs:1256-1259.",Asserts only the last activity after one prompt/stop pair (codex.rs:1235-1260).,Non-resumable identity variant of the Ready mapping; nearest neighbour exact_resume_admits_matching_root_then_reports_new_turn_without_historical_ready is at src/report/codex.rs:785-881,Real Hooks publish path (codex.rs:431-470).,high,keep,Small but distinct Ready path.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr|report%3A%3Acodex%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aexact_resume_admits_matching_root_then_reports_new_turn_without_historical_ready|default""]","[""two drives""]",0.047,0.047,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:609 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,app-report-001,independent-app-check-1
nextest|Test|ovrcr|report%3A%3Ahermes%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aeligible_launch_is_interactive_chat_including_profile_and_resume|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr,lib,unit,report::hermes::tests::eligible_launch_is_interactive_chat_including_profile_and_resume,default,src/report/hermes.rs,432,447,"[""src/report/hermes.rs:71-105""]","Hermes is eligible bare, with a profile flag plus chat, and with --resume plus a session id, while 'hermes doctor' and a different binary name are not eligible.","Treating a doctor/help subcommand as an interactive chat launch and reporting on it, or rejecting a legitimate resumed chat.",2,2,2,4,50,60,56,"Eligibility only decides whether Hermes notices are reported; a wrong result loses or adds reporting for one launch, bounded (2).",src/report/hermes.rs:432-447 asserts five cases through the real function; the flag-value skip and the -- terminator are not exercised beyond the profile case.,Grok has a much broader eligibility matrix; this is the Hermes rule with fewer inputs (2).,Direct production function over argv.,high,keep,Cheap Hermes-specific gate coverage; no equivalent elsewhere.,[],pure argv parsing,0.020,0.020,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:654 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,app-report-002,
