nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aautomatic_titles|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::automatic_titles,integration,unit,live::command_clears_inherited_reporting_authority,default,tests/support/live.rs,568,579,"[""tests/support/live.rs:163-196"", ""tests/support/live.rs:111-149"", ""src/report.rs:76-95"", ""src/cli/agent.rs:106-126""]","The shared `Live` fixture builds every fixture child with Command::env_remove for OVRCR_HOOK_SOCKET, OVRCR_HOOK_TOKEN and OVRCR_SESSION_ID; the test asserts that the Command returned by Live::command() carries each of those three names with a None value, i.e. the removal is present in the exact builder that every test binary spawns.","If one env_remove were dropped, a fixture `ovrcr` child would inherit the developer/CI hook identity: report::HookIdentity::from_environment (src/report.rs:76-95) would send lifecycle reports to that foreign hook socket as that foreign session, and `agent run` would mint OVRCR_DELEGATION_* capability env from it (src/cli/agent.rs:106-126), so fixture agents would report into another instance's session instead of the fixture's own server.",2,3,2,3,50,65,59,"No shipped path is under test, so the blast radius is test infrastructure; the consequence is bounded to test runs and recoverable by clearing the environment, yet a regression silently writes into a developer instance's session through src/report.rs:76-95 and src/cli/agent.rs:106-126, which is why it is above a cosmetic detail.","Three exact positive/negative assertions on Command::get_envs (tests/support/live.rs:570-578) reject the precise defect of a dropped env_remove or a re-added value; they would not catch a later override re-adding the variables in a per-test builder, and nothing spawns the command to read the child's effective environ (that end-to-end form exists only for the shipped runner at tests/cli.rs:2349-2362).","The Live::command() hook-env policy is asserted nowhere else: tests/cli.rs:38-74 checks a different builder (isolated_command) for XDG/CODEX/GROK/CLAUDE/OVRCR_CONFIG keys and never the three hook variables, and tests/cli.rs:2349-2362 checks the shipped agent runner's end-to-end clearing, a different subject. The boundary here is the fixture builder itself (tests/support/live.rs:163-196).",Live::command() is the builder every fixture child is spawned from (tests/support/live.rs:163-196) and the asserted Command env map is the map std propagates to the child; the limit is that the test inspects the builder rather than a spawned child's /proc environ.,high,keep,"The only direct assertion of the shared fixture's hook-identity isolation, which every one of the 28 acceptance binaries depends on; it is the retained representative of an identical 28-way execution (tests/support/live.rs:568-579) and its uniqueness is carried by this row.","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclaude_quota_probe|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclaude_reporting_load|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acli|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclient_startup|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclient_startup_server|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acodex_initial_prompt|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acursor_cloud|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Agit_lifecycle|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Ainitial_prompt|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aoperator_e2e|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aoperator_scope|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Api_delegation|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Api_package|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aprovider_quota|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aquota_ui_option_a_smoke|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aregistry_migration|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aresource_cli|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aretained_capacity|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aretained_ownership|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aretained_sessions|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Asettings_lifecycle|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atask_execution|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aterminal_acceptance|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Awip_save|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aworkspace_identity|live%3A%3Acommand_clears_inherited_reporting_authority|default""]","0.101s first attempt, one hosted attempt (single spawn, no server); the same body is compiled into each of the 28 binaries that #[path]-include tests/support/live.rs, so the run executes 28 copies of these three assertions",0.101,0.101,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:712 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,shared-fixtures-001,independent-shared-check-1
