nextest|Test|ovrcr|remote%3A%3Atests%3A%3Acreate_fields_are_bounded_and_typed|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr,lib,unit,remote::tests::create_fields_are_bounded_and_typed,default,src/remote/mod.rs,867,881,"[""src/remote/mod.rs:533-567"", ""src/remote/mod.rs:425-500""]","required_string trims and accepts a nonempty string within its limit, errors on a missing field and on one over the limit; optional_string maps absent or null to None, accepts a string within the limit and errors above it.","With the empty and length checks removed, a phone client could send an empty project, workspace or agent name or an over-long prompt, which create_session would forward into CreateSessionRequest; the request would fail deep in the server or store an oversized name or label as durable session metadata.",2,2,3,3,50,65,59,"Accepted values become durable session fields and the argv task (src/remote/mod.rs:471-486), so a bounds regression lets junk metadata and an oversized prompt into a session; recoverable by recreating it, hence bounded.","It pins trim, missing, over-length, null and over-length-prompt exactly (src/remote/mod.rs:867-881), but the Some(non-string) branches that give the test its 'typed' name are never taken, and the production maxima (200 and MAX_PROMPT 8000) are replaced by 10, so a wrong production constant passes.","create_session's rejection branches have no other test: tests/remote_web.rs:293-330 only posts a valid payload, so the 400 paths are protected only here.","The real required_string/optional_string functions run, but the boundary is a synthetic max of 10 on the helpers rather than the 200/8000 constants create_session passes (src/remote/mod.rs:440-460), so the production limits are only indirectly represented.",high,keep,"Sole coverage of the remote create validation branches, which are reachable from the phone; keep, with the non-string branch as a known gap.",[],"0.015s one hosted attempt; unit test in the ovrcr lib target, no sockets or child processes",0.015,0.015,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:562 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,app-remote-001,
