python-check|Relocated%20macOS%20startup%20assets|native%2Fbridge%2Fcheck-guards.py|client-op%5B%7B%27type%27%3A%20%27deliver%27%2C%20%27title%27%3A%20%27private%20prompt%27%2C%20%27subtitle%27%3A%20%27x%27%2C%20%27body%27%3A%20%27x%27%7D%5D%3Aln65|production,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Relocated macOS startup assets,python-check,native/bridge/check-guards.py,script-check,acceptance,"client-op[{'type': 'deliver', 'title': 'private prompt', 'subtitle': 'x', 'body': 'x'}]:ln65",production,native/bridge/check-guards.py,65,70,"[""native/bridge/main.swift:23-48"", ""native/bridge/Contract.swift:80-134""]","A request with admitted versions carrying {'type': 'deliver', 'title': 'private prompt', 'subtitle': 'x', 'body': 'x'} yields status 'failed' on the production bundle, because the payload has no navigation ticket and the deliver guard rejects it before the title allowlist is consulted.","A deliver operation missing a required field (here navigation, but title/subtitle/body are decoded and checked in the same guard) reaching the notification path; the row's stated defects - a non-allowlisted title, a control character or an oversized body - are not discriminated, because the same payload already fails the navigation conjunct.",3,2,1,4,75,50,60,"The deliver fields are the user-visible notification payload admitted before IPC (native/bridge/Contract.swift:110-120); malformed deliver ops must not reach the notification path, though this row only proves the required-field gate.","The assertion is one expected 'failed' status (native/bridge/check-guards.py:65-70) whose actual cause is the missing navigation ticket (native/bridge/Contract.swift:112-113); the title allowlist and the subtitle/body bounds at Contract.swift:114-117 are never exercised, so a regression accepting 'private prompt' with a valid ticket would still pass.",One of five op shapes in the same loop (native/bridge/check-guards.py:65-70); it adds no boundary over the missing-field case because the payload fails an earlier conjunct (native/bridge/Contract.swift:112-113).,The real compiled bridge binary runs with real stdin bytes in the built bundle (native/bridge/check-guards.py:38-46).,high,keep,"It is still the only guard test that drives a deliver op through the compiled binary, but its stated title/subtitle/body protection is not effective; keep with the corrected scores and add a valid navigation ticket per case to restore it.",[],"[""spawns the compiled bridge once per operation""]",,,,,unmeasured,"suite aggregate only: macOS-job.log:3636 (40 checks) '40 compiled-entry and bundle-layout guard checks passed; pinned entitlement SHA256 c479446ccc1537f8b64d0bc2c4a7b5a64f80753659d0cdf5450c2927df8eb29b; no admitted request, IPC or native app lifecycle.' (run 42429838269 job 128576086691 step 'Relocated macOS startup assets')",packaging-installers-001,independent-packaging-check-1
