python-check|Relocated%20macOS%20startup%20assets|native%2Fbridge%2Fcheck-startup-package.py|relocated-validator-accepts%3Aln32|local-development,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Relocated macOS startup assets,python-check,native/bridge/check-startup-package.py,script-check,acceptance,relocated-validator-accepts:ln32,local-development,native/bridge/check-startup-package.py,32,33,"[""native/bridge/validate-bundle.py:20-89""]",The packaged local-development payload copied outside the checkout is accepted by its own validator with exit 0.,"Validation depending on the checkout path or the original location, so a relocated install validates differently.",3,2,1,4,75,50,60,"The startup payload is validated where the client will read it, outside the repo (native/bridge/check-startup-package.py:28-34).",Asserts only exit 0; later mutations assert what must fail.,"Baseline for the local payload, whose validator pins the local identity (native/bridge/validate-bundle.py:49-53).",Real packaged payload copied to a temp directory and the production validator.,high,keep,Baseline kept for its profile.,[],"[""copies the packaged payload to a temp dir and runs the validator""]",,,,,unmeasured,suite aggregate only: macOS-job.log:3644 (28 checks) '28 relocated startup payload checks passed; pinned entitlement SHA256 c479446ccc1537f8b64d0bc2c4a7b5a64f80753659d0cdf5450c2927df8eb29b; no install or app launch' (run 42429838269 job 128576086691 step 'Relocated macOS startup assets'),packaging-installers-001,
