_and_never_gates|default""]","[""sixteen doctor spawns plus fake executables"", ""temp HOME""]",0.538,0.538,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:690 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,other-rust-integration-001,
