nextest|Test|ovrcr-tui|dashboard%3A%3Atests%3A%3Adashboard_wait_reports_input_and_output_together|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-tui,lib,integration,dashboard::tests::dashboard_wait_reports_input_and_output_together,default,crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/tests.rs,545,563,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/event_loop.rs:667-717""]",wait_for_dashboard_activity with a readable stdin descriptor and a readable wake socket returns input_ready and server_ready in the same result.,"The loop reporting only one readiness source (input or server wake), so typed input or Server output waits for the other event before the dashboard notices it.",2,3,2,4,50,70,62,"A missed readiness only delays an event loop pass (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/event_loop.rs:667-717), a bounded responsiveness failure rather than a workflow or data failure.",Writes one byte to both real sockets and asserts both flags on the single returned DashboardActivity (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/tests.rs:545-561).,The sibling dashboard_output_wake_interrupts_idle_wait covers output readiness alone; the both-ready combination and the input flag are covered only here (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/event_loop.rs:667-717).,"The subject is OS-level readiness (libc poll over real UnixStream descriptors), and the test passes real descriptors, so the boundary is genuine (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/event_loop.rs:667-717).",high,keep,"Kept: criticality 2 and derived usefulness 70 do not meet the prune gate, and no test named in the uniqueness note covers the same assertion and input (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/event_loop.rs:667-717).","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-tui|dashboard%3A%3Atests%3A%3Adashboard_output_wake_interrupts_idle_wait|default""]","[""UnixStream::pair for input and wake"", ""nonblocking descriptors"", ""500 ms poll timeout""]",0.011,0.011,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:3317 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,tui-library-006,
