python-check|Relocated%20macOS%20startup%20assets|native%2Fbridge%2Fcheck-guards.py|contract-available%3Aln50|local-development,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Relocated macOS startup assets,python-check,native/bridge/check-guards.py,script-check,acceptance,contract-available:ln50,local-development,native/bridge/check-guards.py,50,50,"[""native/bridge/main.swift:14-48"", ""native/bridge/Contract.swift:80-134""]","`OVRCRBridge --check-contract <schema> <wire>` on the local-development bundle exits 0, writes nothing to stderr, and prints exactly one JSON line with the bundle's schema/wire and status 'available'.","The compiled contract check reporting a mismatch for the versions the bundle itself declares, so the Dashboard refuses a working bridge.",3,4,0,4,75,60,66,The contract handshake decides whether the Dashboard may use the bridge at all (native/bridge/main.swift:14-21).,"Asserts the exact exit code, empty stderr, single newline-terminated JSON line and the status value.","The same contract statement runs in both modes; the mode only changes the bundle's identity marker, which this guard does not read (native/bridge/main.swift:14-21).",Executes the real compiled bridge binary in the built bundle.,high,consolidate,No mode-dependent branch: retain the production contract-available row.,"[""python-check|Relocated%20macOS%20startup%20assets|native%2Fbridge%2Fcheck-guards.py|contract-available%3Aln50|production""]","[""spawns the compiled bridge once""]",,,,,unmeasured,"suite aggregate only: macOS-job.log:3646 (40 checks) '40 compiled-entry and bundle-layout guard checks passed; pinned entitlement SHA256 c479446ccc1537f8b64d0bc2c4a7b5a64f80753659d0cdf5450c2927df8eb29b; no admitted request, IPC or native app lifecycle.' (run 42429838269 job 128576086691 step 'Relocated macOS startup assets')",packaging-installers-001,independent-packaging-check-1
