nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Abin%2Fovrcr-gui|command_palette_opens_when_another_control_has_focus|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::bin/ovrcr-gui,bin,acceptance,command_palette_opens_when_another_control_has_focus,default,src/bin/ovrcr-gui.rs,693,906,"[""src/bin/ovrcr-gui.rs:453-470"", ""src/bin/ovrcr-gui.rs:498-552""]","App::show consumes Cmd-K before the terminal widget, requests terminal focus whenever the palette opens or no widget holds focus, keeps the pending intent across startup offers and dashboard restarts, and injects the dashboard palette sequence only on an alternate-screen dashboard that shows OVRCR.","If Cmd-K were handled only while the terminal already had focus, or focus stayed on another control, the GUI's command palette could not be opened whenever another widget had focus and the key would leak to that widget or be typed into the terminal instead.",2,3,3,4,50,80,68,"Losing the host shortcut degrades one navigation affordance with a workaround (the dashboard's own palette keys and the TUI), so it is a bounded feature failure (src/bin/ovrcr-gui.rs:453-470).","It asserts that focus left the competing control, that the key event was consumed, that the palette appears within five seconds after both a live and a stopped dashboard, and that it survives the Command release (src/bin/ovrcr-gui.rs:784-900); the palette check is a substring wait, so it cannot tell which palette state opened.","tests/gui.rs:282-384 drives the Dashboard palette API and tests/gui.rs:258-281 checks the key encoder, so the egui host focus and global-shortcut failure mode (src/bin/ovrcr-gui.rs:453-470, src/bin/ovrcr-gui.rs:500-520) is only covered here.","It runs real egui frames against a real App with a real dashboard process and PTY, including the actual event plumbing that decides focus and key consumption (src/bin/ovrcr-gui.rs:697-720).",high,keep,Distinct integration boundary (host window focus and key routing) with real processes; keep.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Agui|palette_creates_switches_and_closes_a_real_terminal|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Agui|command_k_is_not_forwarded_to_terminal|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Agui|gui_command_shortcuts_do_not_activate_control_jump|default""]","7.372s one hosted attempt; spawns a real dashboard on a PTY, drives a live and a restarted dashboard, and polls the screen for up to 5s in each variant",7.372,7.372,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2359 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,app-core-001,independent-shared-check-1
