nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|desktop_notifications_bridge_expired_permission_check_recovers_without_reauthorization|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::server_lifecycle,integration,integration,desktop_notifications_bridge_expired_permission_check_recovers_without_reauthorization,default,tests/server_lifecycle.rs,18457,18543,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/desktop.rs:444-520"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/desktop.rs:86-120""]","With permission pending, the dashboard waits out the real 30s polling budget (asserted >=30s) then shows permission unconfirmed with an explicit check action; polling stops (record unchanged for 1.2s); a late deny is learned via one status, a second action opens Settings (no Confirm), and a later allow clears everything without delivery or fallback.","Expired permission checking could poll forever, auto-reauthorize, or fail to surface recovery, leaving notifications silently off.",2,3,3,4,50,80,68,Expired-permission UX is bounded; the worst outcome is notifications off with a workaround (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/desktop.rs:444-520).,"Asserts the elapsed lower bound, stopped polling, exact control sequence and no delivery; the 36s deadline makes it the most expensive row in the shard (tests/server_lifecycle.rs:18465-18540).",Only row covering expiry of the permission polling budget (tests/server_lifecycle.rs:18457-18543).,Real dashboard PTY with a real 30s production polling budget (tests/server_lifecycle.rs:18459-18475).,high,keep,Grounded expiry recovery; cost is real but value specific.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|desktop_notifications_bridge_pending_permission_does_not_repeat_or_block_input|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|desktop_notifications_bridge_denied_settings_are_explicit_and_never_modal_or_automatic|default""]","[""36s wall-clock budget"", ""dashboard PTY"", ""bridge request record""]",35.784,35.784,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1517 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,lifecycle-terminal-acceptance-002,independent-lifecycle-check-1
