nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aautomatic_titles|title_model_missing_mismatches_terminal_and_grok_do_not_spawn_pi|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::automatic_titles,integration,acceptance,title_model_missing_mismatches_terminal_and_grok_do_not_spawn_pi,default,tests/automatic_titles.rs,716,784,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/title.rs:174-215"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/title.rs:780-800"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/title.rs:852-880""]","With no title_model configured, creates a terminal session and a Grok agent session and asserts after three seconds that both keep their creation names and that the fake title provider was never invoked.","The title worker calling the model for a terminal session, a Grok session, or with no configured model at all, which would send transcript content to a provider without the user opting in.",3,2,3,3,75,65,69,An unauthorized provider call transmits conversation or shell content off the machine; the title itself being absent is cosmetic but the spawn is a privacy event.,"Only absence is asserted: `!calls.exists()` plus unchanged names after a 3 s settle, with no positive control in this body, so an inert title worker would also pass and a suppression regression is caught only if a call would write the marker file.",No-model plus terminal plus Grok suppression is unique; row 26 covers terminal exclusion with a positive control.,"Real server, real terminal PTY and a fake model executable; the provider is the controlled dependency.",high,keep,"Suppression of the model spawn is a privacy-relevant invariant, and row 26 supplies the missing positive control for the terminal half.","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aautomatic_titles|terminal_with_retained_agent_does_not_spawn_title_pi|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aautomatic_titles|title_model_set_and_cleared_while_running_starts_and_stops_titling|default""]","[""3 s settle sleep"", ""fake-pi script that appends on invocation"", ""server spawn""]",6.397,6.397,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:725 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,other-rust-integration-001,independent-integration-check-1
