node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_delegation_extension.mjs|prepare-only%20invalid%20flags%20refuse%20before%20control%20or%20private%20intent%20effects|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Extension tests,node-test,tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs,node,integration,prepare-only invalid flags refuse before control or private intent effects,default,tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs,675,688,"[""src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:171-350"", ""src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:472-656""]","prepare_only values null, 0, 1, 'true', {} and [] are all Refused/NotSent without any control call and without creating parent-intents; a handle replay with prepare_only 'true' also refuses without transport.","If a truthy non-boolean such as 'true' were coerced, a caller that passed garbage would reserve (or worse, reject after effects) instead of getting a typed error, and if 0/1 were coerced a reservation could become a real dispatch.",3,3,2,3,75,65,69,The flag decides whether a child is launched; coercion of a non-boolean can flip reservation into dispatch (src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:474-475).,Six invalid values plus a handle-replay variant are asserted with no control file and no intent directory (tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs:675-688).,"The reservation rows use a valid boolean; the type-refusal branch is distinct and only here; the handler it drives is src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:474-475, which no other reviewed case exercises.",The real start callback's typeof check runs with all child-process launches available but never used (src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:472-477).,high,keep,Covers the prepare_only type boundary; keep.,[],0.049s reported for this case; ordinary node:test case in the 'Extension tests' batch,0.049,0.049,1,0,hosted-single-run,TAP duration_ms 49.245208 at macOS-job.log:4017; run 42429838269 job 128576086691 step 'Extension tests',extensions-installed-pi-001,
node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_package_bootstrap.mjs|malformed%20or%20incompatible%20owner%20metadata%20refuses%20%282%20bytes%29|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Extension tests,node-test,tests/pi_package_bootstrap.mjs,node,unit,malformed or incompatible owner metadata refuses (2 bytes),default,tests/pi_package_bootstrap.mjs,55,60,"[""pi/extension.ts:1-6"", ""src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:33-93""]","A selection payload of {} makes the handler notify one 'unsupported managed-entry metadata' warning and register nothing, without touching the filesystem or the tool registry.","If {} were accepted, the package would either crash on load or try to certify an entry from unusable metadata, and in the oversized case allocate/parse above the intended 8 KiB bound.",3,3,2,3,75,65,69,The selection names the entry OVRCR will trust as the runtime owner; accepting malformed metadata either invents an owner or aborts the diagnostic (src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:39-46).,It asserts exactly one notice with the unsupported-metadata text and zero registrations for the {} input (tests/pi_package_bootstrap.mjs:55-60).,"The five malformed rows share one body and one rejection message; each supplies a different failing predicate (JSON parse, missing keys, wrong schema, non-absolute path, byte-length bound), so the rows together cover the validator's branches.",The real packageIssue parse/validate block runs; the Pi API is a fixture (src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:39-46).,high,keep,Distinct malformed input of the same validator; the whole set is the coverage.,"[""node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_package_bootstrap.mjs|malformed%20or%20incompatible%20owner%20metadata%20refuses%20%288%20bytes%29|default""]",0.000082916s reported for this case; ordinary node:test case in the 'Extension tests' batch,0.000082916,0.000082916,1,0,hosted-single-run,TAP duration_ms 0.082916 at macOS-job.log:4137; run 42429838269 job 128576086691 step 'Extension tests',extensions-installed-pi-001,
