nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime%3A%3Atheme_catalog|research_only_families_remain_invalid_and_do_not_replace_saved_theme|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime::theme_catalog,integration,integration,research_only_families_remain_invalid_and_do_not_replace_saved_theme,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/tests/theme_catalog.rs,53,64,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/settings/write.rs:18-63"", ""crates/ovrcr-protocol/src/settings.rs:240-330""]","With theme 'catppuccin-mocha' saved, the four research-only family names are refused by set() and the document stays byte-identical, so the saved theme survives.",Accepting a research-only theme family (shipping an unaudited theme) or a failed save clobbering the saved theme.,2,4,3,4,50,90,74,"An unapproved theme is a visual/design-lock issue, not a destructive one (crates/ovrcr-protocol/src/settings.rs:240-330).",Asserts an error and exact byte equality of the document for each of four names.,No other test asserts the research-only exclusion through the writer (crates/ovrcr-runtime/tests/theme_catalog.rs:53-64).,Real document through the production writer.,high,keep,Only research-only theme refusal coverage.,[],"[""four refused names on one document""]",0.015,0.015,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2888 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-storage-settings-tasks-003,
nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|catalog_process%3A%3Atests%3A%3Abounded_pipe_capture_keeps_complete_output_across_drain_iterations|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime,lib,integration,catalog_process::tests::bounded_pipe_capture_keeps_complete_output_across_drain_iterations,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs,784,801,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:182-257"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:88-181""]","run_command drains a child that writes 196,608 bytes of stdout across multiple 64 KiB iterations with a 256 KiB budget, returning the complete stdout, zero stderr total, and an Empty owner state.","A drain loop that loses or duplicates a chunk at an iteration boundary, truncates at the per-iteration cap instead of the total budget, or leaves the owner non-empty after a clean exit.",2,4,3,4,50,90,74,"Truncated catalog output yields a partial model list or a spurious parse failure (catalog_process.rs:182-257); a bounded discovery failure the user can retry, C=2.","The exact stdout length 196,608, stderr_total 0 and OwnerState::Empty (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:784-801) reject off-by-chunk loss, duplication and a stale owner; the budget/chunk split is exactly what the drain loop must handle.",The only test of the bounded capture loop; the sibling tests target ownership after the child exits or is held. No counterpart test in the inventory; production surface: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:182-257.,Real child process (`/usr/bin/head` on `/dev/zero`) with production pipes and drain loop (F=4). Exercised production path: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:88-181.,high,keep,Exact byte-count invariant across the drain boundary.,[],spawns a real child and pipes 192 KiB,0.160,0.160,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2341 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-storage-settings-tasks-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|catalog_process%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aunknown_nonmatching_child_blocks_repeated_spawns_until_it_is_waited|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime,lib,integration,catalog_process::tests::unknown_nonmatching_child_blocks_repeated_spawns_until_it_is_waited,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs,804,877,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:258-330""]","After adopting a child whose process group does not match its pid, resolve_existing_with_budget, a new run_command and a second resolution all fail without spawning a replacement; once the child exits and is observed, resolution succeeds, the exact pid is waited, the group is gone and the owner is Empty.","Spawning a replacement catalog process while an unknown child still owns resources, or dropping the retained child so it is never waited.",2,4,3,4,50,90,74,"The refusals prevent duplicate/orphaned native processes during model discovery (catalog_process.rs:258-330); a bounded resource/ownership failure, not durable state, C=2.","Three independent refusals, a no-spawn file assertion, then a successful recovery plus pid-absence and group-absence checks (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:859-876) form a complete transition invariant.",Only test of the unknown-ownership refusal; the reaped-group test covers a different unresolved state (leader already waited). No counterpart test in the inventory; production surface: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:258-330.,"Real child in a nonmatching group, real process-group probes and production CatalogProcessOwner (F=4). Exercised production path: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:258-330.",high,keep,Exercises the refusal and the eventual recovery with real processes.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|catalog_process%3A%3Atests%3A%3Areaped_group_uncertainty_is_read_only_until_descendant_exit|default""]",spawns a shell child and polls file/pid state,2.358,2.358,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2361 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-storage-settings-tasks-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|claude_delegation%3A%3Atests%3A%3Adashboard_catalog_does_not_drop_child_when_cleanup_probe_fails|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime,lib,integration,claude_delegation::tests::dashboard_catalog_does_not_drop_child_when_cleanup_probe_fails,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs,1063,1130,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:288-340"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:258-330""]","With the next cleanup waitid forced to fail, catalog initialization returns an error, the owner retains/resolves the child, and the direct child is nevertheless waited (ECHILD) rather than dropped.","Treating a failed cleanup probe as permission to forget the child, leaking an un-waited native process when cleanup cannot be verified.",2,4,3,4,50,90,74,"Dropping a child on a cleanup error leaks one native process and its group (claude_delegation.rs:288-340); bounded, C=2.","The injected failure must produce Err (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:1063-1105) and then the child must still be reaped, proved by ECHILD (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:1108-1129) — the negative and the recovery are both asserted.","The only test of cleanup-uncertainty handling; the success test proves the normal wait, and this proves the child survives an uncertain probe. No counterpart test in the inventory; production surface: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:288-340.",Real child process with a test-only fault injection into the production wait path (fail_next_catalog_cleanup_waitid) that exercises the real error branch rather than bypassing it (F=4). Exercised production path: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:258-330.,high,keep,Fault-injected branch is real code; the child-reaping outcome is measured.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|claude_delegation%3A%3Atests%3A%3Adashboard_catalog_waits_for_native_child_after_successful_eof|default""]","spawns a shell script, injects a waitid failure, polls waitid",0.131,0.131,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2345 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-storage-settings-tasks-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|claude_delegation%3A%3Atests%3A%3Adashboard_catalog_waits_for_native_child_after_successful_eof|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime,lib,integration,claude_delegation::tests::dashboard_catalog_waits_for_native_child_after_successful_eof,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs,973,1060,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:288-340""]","After the fake claude answers with a control_response and exits, catalog initialization returns the parsed (alias, resolved) pair only after the direct child has been waited (waitid reports ECHILD) and its process group is absent.","Returning on stdout EOF without reaping the direct child, leaving a zombie and an unowned process group after every successful discovery.",2,4,3,4,50,90,74,"An un-waited child leaks a zombie per model discovery (claude_delegation.rs:288-340); bounded resource/ownership impact, C=2.","ECHILD from waitid proves the exact child was waited, ESRCH proves the group is gone, and the result equals [(""sonnet"",""claude-sonnet-4-6"")] (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:1043-1059) — decisive for the wait-before-return claim.",Only the success/EOF path asserts waiting; the failure-injection test covers cleanup uncertainty. No counterpart test in the inventory; production surface: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:288-340.,"Real fake claude script, production catalog initialization and real waitid/signal probes (F=4). Exercised production path: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:288-340.",high,keep,Directly measures child reaping on the success path.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|claude_delegation%3A%3Atests%3A%3Adashboard_catalog_does_not_drop_child_when_cleanup_probe_fails|default""]","spawns a shell script, polls waitid",0.078,0.078,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2348 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-storage-settings-tasks-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|claude_delegation%3A%3Atests%3A%3Anative_catalog_preserves_alias_and_refuses_missing_or_conflicting_resolution|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime,lib,unit,claude_delegation::tests::native_catalog_preserves_alias_and_refuses_missing_or_conflicting_resolution,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs,1133,1150,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:179-262""]","The native catalog parser keeps an alias together with its resolved model id, returns empty when resolution is missing, errors on one alias resolving to two models or on an invalid model name, and gates versions below 2.1.300.","Collapsing an alias to its resolved id (or vice versa), accepting a model name that cannot be launched, or accepting a claude version whose catalog shape is unsupported.",2,4,3,4,50,90,74,"A wrong catalog makes delegation select a model the native CLI cannot run (claude_delegation.rs:179-262); bounded to launch failure, C=2.","Four independent parse expectations plus the exact version boundary 2.1.299/2.1.300 (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:1134-1149) reject alias collapse, duplicate resolution and boundary drift.",Only test of the model/version parser; the dashboard catalog tests cover argv and process ownership instead. No counterpart test in the inventory; production surface: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:179-262.,Direct calls to production models() and version() (F=4). Exercised production path: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:179-262.,high,keep,Distinct parser boundary with exact expectations and a version cutoff.,[],JSON parsing only,0.012,0.012,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2349 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-storage-settings-tasks-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|claude_delegation%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aserver_shutdown_cancels_a_held_native_catalog_process_group|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime,lib,integration,claude_delegation::tests::server_shutdown_cancels_a_held_native_catalog_process_group,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs,876,970,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:288-340"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:182-330""]","A held fake catalog (leader plus sleeping descendant, both in the leader's group) is cancelled by setting shutdown: the worker finishes within 250 ms, returns 'native model discovery cancelled', and both the leader and descendant are gone (ESRCH).","Shutdown that leaves the native catalog process or its descendant running after the server stops, or returns as if discovery succeeded.",2,4,3,4,50,90,74,"A leaked catalog child keeps a native claude process alive after the server exits (claude_delegation.rs:288-340); bounded and killed by the OS eventually, so C=2.","It pins the cancelled error string, termination of the exact leader and descendant by ESRCH, and the group's absence (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:952-969); the bounded wait distinguishes cancellation from a slow finish.",The only shutdown-cancellation test for the Claude catalog; the success-path test covers EOF/wait instead. No counterpart test in the inventory; production surface: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/claude_delegation.rs:288-340.,"Real script process group with a held descendant, production cancellable catalog path and real signals (F=4). Exercised production path: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:182-330.",high,keep,Proves both processes are gone after shutdown rather than merely returning.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|claude_delegation%3A%3Atests%3A%3Adashboard_catalog_waits_for_native_child_after_successful_eof|default""]","spawns a script with a background sleep, polls pid files, sends signals",0.105,0.105,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2350 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-storage-settings-tasks-001,
