nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|codex_delegation%3A%3Atests%3A%3Adashboard_catalog_cancellation_terminates_its_owned_process_group|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime,lib,integration,codex_delegation::tests::dashboard_catalog_cancellation_terminates_its_owned_process_group,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/codex_delegation.rs,1285,1360,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/codex_delegation.rs:331-430""]","A fake app server that waits for a release file publishes its pid, is confirmed group leader, then cancellation makes the worker finish with an error containing 'cancelled' and the whole group absent (ESRCH).","Shutdown that returns without terminating the owned Codex app-server group, leaving a native process running after the dashboard closes.",2,4,3,4,50,90,74,"A leaked app server survives dashboard cancellation (codex_delegation.rs:331-430); bounded to a stray process, C=2.","Group-leader premise, prompt finish, the cancelled error, and group ESRCH (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/codex_delegation.rs:1341-1359) prove termination rather than just return.",The only Codex cancellation test; the shutdown path for Claude's catalog is a different implementation. No counterpart test in the inventory; production surface: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/codex_delegation.rs:331-430.,Real fake-codex process group plus production cancellation (F=4). Exercised production path: crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/codex_delegation.rs:331-430.,high,keep,"Asserts the whole group is gone, not merely that the worker returned.","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|codex_delegation%3A%3Atests%3A%3Astartup_config_output_overflow_reaps_its_native_child|default""]","fake codex script, thread, release file, signals",0.683,0.683,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2355 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-storage-settings-tasks-001,
