unt_crosses_nine|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|session_jump_single_digit%3A%3Ainvalidated_ninth_target_keeps_its_label_without_selecting_a_neighbor|default""]",Three full sidebar renders across two hierarchy snapshots,0.040,0.040,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1756 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,independent-dashboard-check-1
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|agent_search%3A%3Aunverified_frontend_keeps_control_hold_and_command_out_of_browse_actions|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,agent_search::unverified_frontend_keeps_control_hold_and_command_out_of_browse_actions,default,tests/tui/agent_search.rs,435,487,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/mod.rs:104-120"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/keymap.rs:228-260"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/keymap.rs:440-470""]","With the Standard input profile, the Control hold never labels or advertises itself, Cmd-k is not stripped into the Browse k binding, Ctrl+2 stays the ordinary NUL Terminal byte, and the footer and focus are unchanged.","The OVRCR-GUI-only gesture or Command folding enabled in an arbitrary terminal, stealing a program's Ctrl+2 NUL or the user's Cmd-k.",3,3,3,3,75,75,75,"Lost terminal input: a program that expects Ctrl+2 gets nothing, and Cmd shortcuts become Browse actions (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/mod.rs:110-118; keymap.rs:440-470).","Compares the footer string before and after, asserts no labels, unchanged focus, empty outbox, PtyBytes([0]) in Terminal, and the env-value mapping (tests/tui/agent_search.rs:435-487).",Only test of the input-profile gate for this gesture; palette and operator suites assume VerifiedOvrcrGui (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/keymap.rs:440-470).,"Real profile parsing, keymap gate, event dispatch and terminal encoding; the subject is Dashboard dispatch, not a child process (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/mod.rs:110-118).",high,keep,Unique guard against enabling GUI-only input handling in a standard terminal.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|operator%3A%3Aoperator_control_jump_does_not_reveal_its_on_demand_sidebar|default""]",Four full renders and one terminal-mode entry,0.068,0.068,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1764 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|bridge_navigation%3A%3Abridge_navigation_cancels_pending_history_and_releases_late_original_capture|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,bridge_navigation::bridge_navigation_cancels_pending_history_and_releases_late_original_capture,default,tests/tui/bridge_navigation.rs,434,481,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/navigation.rs:106-131"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/state.rs:4564-4595""]","Navigating while a HistoryBegin is pending releases the late original capture with HistoryEnd, shows no history overlay, and leaves no copy action.",A frozen snapshot leaked (never ended) and an overlay for the old session appearing after navigation.,3,3,3,3,75,75,75,Server snapshot/capture ownership: an unended capture keeps a stale parser bound while the pane shows another session (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/navigation.rs:106-131; state.rs:4564-4595).,"Asserts the HistoryEnd with the original snapshot, focus on the new session, no HISTORY text and no CopyText action (tests/tui/bridge_navigation.rs:434-481).",The pending-begin release path under navigation is unique (tests/tui/copy_history.rs:1439-1510 covers local cancels).,"Real Dashboard history ownership, navigation and render (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/navigation.rs:106-131).",high,keep,Only test of a late HistoryOpened after bridge navigation.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|bridge_navigation%3A%3Abridge_navigation_releases_active_history_and_rejects_late_original_rows|default""]",One HistoryBegin and one late HistoryOpened,0.060,0.060,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1763 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|bridge_navigation%3A%3Abridge_navigation_discards_unsent_palette_draft_and_ignores_submitted_completion|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,bridge_navigation::bridge_navigation_discards_unsent_palette_draft_and_ignores_submitted_completion,default,tests/tui/bridge_navigation.rs,376,431,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/navigation.rs:106-131"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/palette.rs:4373-4384""]","Navigation discards an unsent palette draft so it neither survives nor reappears on the next palette, and a submitted session-creation result arriving late does not retarget the navigated pane or rewrite the submitted target.","The private typed draft left in the palette after navigation, or a late CreatedSession completion stealing focus from the clicked session.",3,3,3,3,75,75,75,A late completion retargeting the user's pane would put the next keystrokes in a session they never chose (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/navigation.rs:106-131).,"Asserts the draft absent after navigation and after a fresh palette, the late completion not changing focus, the original target unchanged, and no leftover creation form (tests/tui/bridge_navigation.rs:376-431).",Numeric draft/private-state and late-submission handling are unique to this test (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/navigation.rs:106-131).,"Real palette, creation form and CreateSession response through the Dashboard; fixtures are protocol messages (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/navigation.rs:106-131).",high,keep,Only coverage of private draft disposal and a late creation completion under navigation.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|palette%3A%3Aoperator_quick_notification_retarget_cancels_unsent_and_retains_submitted_continuation|default""]","Two dashboards, a form submission and two palette renders",0.085,0.085,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1765 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|bridge_navigation%3A%3Abridge_navigation_focuses_existing_pane_and_retargets_only_the_focused_pane|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,bridge_navigation::bridge_navigation_focuses_existing_pane_and_retargets_only_the_focused_pane,default,tests/tui/bridge_navigation.rs,126,163,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/navigation.rs:106-131"", ""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/navigation.rs:56-105""]",A confirmed bridge navigation to an already-shown session focuses its pane without changing the view; navigation to an unshown session replaces only the focused pane and leaves the peer assignment intact.,"Navigation adding a duplicate pane owner or replacing the peer pane, so the user loses the other split.",3,3,3,3,75,75,75,Wrong pane/session ownership in a split: the peer pane and its input target must survive (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/navigation.rs:106-131).,"Asserts two panes before and after, peer membership retained, and the old focused session removed (tests/tui/bridge_navigation.rs:126-163).",Only test for the already-assigned retarget branch of apply_notification_navigation (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/navigation.rs:106-131).,Real Dashboard handler with protocol offers; no stand-in for navigation or view selection (crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/navigation.rs:106-131).,high,keep,The only test distinguishing already-assigned from unshown retargeting.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|bridge_navigation%3A%3Abridge_navigation_keeps_old_input_bound_and_requires_complete_current_view_ack|default""]",Two split creations and four view acknowledgements,0.053,0.053,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1766 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-001,independent-dashboard-check-1
