nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime%3A%3Adelegation_cancellation_state|delivery_or_agent_end_cannot_confirm_settlement|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime::delegation_cancellation_state,integration,unit,delivery_or_agent_end_cannot_confirm_settlement,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/tests/delegation_cancellation_state.rs,194,229,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_cancellation.rs:125-160""]","A baseline captured on a Busy turn cannot confirm settlement from the same unchanged evidence or from a newer activity revision; settlement confirms only when the state becomes Idle/Error/ResponseReady with a newer activity revision, settled native control and a newer native control revision.","Delivery completion or agent end alone confirming settlement, so a cancelled turn is recorded as settled although the native turn never acknowledged the interrupt.",3,4,2,3,75,75,75,Settlement confirmation decides whether cancellation is complete; confirming without native evidence records an effect that did not happen (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_cancellation.rs:125-160).,"Four refusals (same evidence, new revision only) and three acceptances with both revisions bumped and settled true (crates/ovrcr-runtime/tests/delegation_cancellation_state.rs:197-219).","The branch at crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_cancellation.rs:125-160: same confirm_settlement contract as nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime%3A%3Adelegation_cancellation_state|settlement_cannot_cross_turn_binding_run_version_or_server_replacement|default, which mutates identity/binding instead; this case isolates the revision/settled evidence.",Component logic via the test-only TestAuthority; the real interrupt sample types are production (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_cancellation.rs:125-160).,high,keep,Positive and negative settlement evidence pairs.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime%3A%3Adelegation_cancellation_state|settlement_cannot_cross_turn_binding_run_version_or_server_replacement|default""]","[""one nextest process""]",0.014,0.014,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2837 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-delegation-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime%3A%3Adelegation_fallback_files|any_assignment_reporting_or_control_change_invalidates_captured_attribution|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime::delegation_fallback_files,integration,integration,any_assignment_reporting_or_control_change_invalidates_captured_attribution,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/tests/delegation_fallback_files.rs,473,519,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_fallback.rs:70-122""]","Eighteen context fields (identity instance/attempt/contract/run/session/controller epoch, result version, binding provider/invocation/conversation/generation, control epoch/human revision/owner Human and Uncertain/attribution flag/both barrier kinds) each make validate_capture fail, as does a replacement server lifetime on the author.","A captured attribution surviving any reporting or control change, so evidence captured under one owner/binding is published after the human took control or the child rebound.",3,4,2,3,75,75,75,The capture is only valid for the exact context and author that produced it; any drift is a different owner (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_fallback.rs:70-122).,"Eighteen mutations each error through validate_capture, plus the server-lifetime replacement (crates/ovrcr-runtime/tests/delegation_fallback_files.rs:511-518).","The branch at crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_fallback.rs:70-122: one of three validate_capture families; the distinct input here is the fallback context, whereas nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime%3A%3Adelegation_fallback_files|canonical_reporting_and_publication_revisions_must_still_match_the_capture|default varies the canonical evidence and nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime%3A%3Adelegation_fallback_files|matching_canonical_evidence_cannot_describe_a_different_context_or_valid_publication|default the evidence-versus-context relation.",Calls the production validate_capture against a constructed capture; no file is read on this path (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_fallback.rs:70-122).,high,keep,Eighteen-field context matrix with one author mismatch.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime%3A%3Adelegation_fallback_files|canonical_reporting_and_publication_revisions_must_still_match_the_capture|default""]","[""one nextest process; 19 generated contexts""]",0.080,0.080,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2847 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-delegation-002,independent-runtime-delegation-check-1
