nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Aagent_models%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aunresolved_catalog_child_blocks_repeated_spawns_and_bounded_shutdown_until_waited|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime,lib,integration,server::agent_models::tests::unresolved_catalog_child_blocks_repeated_spawns_and_bounded_shutdown_until_waited,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/agent_models.rs,724,840,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/agent_models.rs:74-160"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:182-330"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/mod.rs:1988-2010""]","With a CatalogQueue whose process owner retains a live child that is not a process-group leader, try_shutdown returns Err while the exact Child stays owned, a repeated with_process_owner spawn returns Err and leaves no marker file, and after the child is released a new spawn succeeds only when both the retained pid and its process group report ESRCH; the accepted permit then closes admission so a later with_process_owner fails.","An owner that admitted a second native catalog child, or accepted shutdown, while the previous child's process group was unresolved, and an owner that reused the launcher without waiting the exact retained Child.",3,4,2,3,75,75,75,"crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:14-20 states that one unresolved catalog process must gate the next spawn and shutdown; breaching it leaves an orphaned native process and a shutdown that claims cleanup it cannot prove, which is wrong process ownership (3).","crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/agent_models.rs:775-840 asserts refusal of shutdown and of the repeat spawn, absence of the refused marker, exact pid and group absence after recovery, and refusal after close, i.e. positive and negative state for the same invariant (4).","crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/catalog_process.rs:804-877 exercises the same retention branch directly on CatalogProcessOwner; this row adds the queue-level try_shutdown permit and post-close admission refusal, a distinct integration boundary inside the same contract (2).","crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/agent_models.rs:724-840 uses the production CatalogProcessOwner, CatalogCapture and a real /bin/sh child with libc probes; only the catalog sink is synthesized, so the claimed process-ownership boundary is real.",high,keep,"Adds the shutdown-permit and admission-closure path that no other test covers, and the C=3 process-ownership invariant is worth the duplicate core checks.","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|catalog_process%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aunknown_nonmatching_child_blocks_repeated_spawns_until_it_is_waited|default""]",spawns a /bin/sh child with a 10ms sleep loop; polls readiness every 5ms up to 2s; libc kill/getpgid probes,4.272,4.272,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2601 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-server-session-001,independent-runtime-check-1
