nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Asettings_lifecycle|quota_enabled_flipped_in_the_file_starts_and_stops_the_collector|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::settings_lifecycle,integration,acceptance,quota_enabled_flipped_in_the_file_starts_and_stops_the_collector,default,tests/settings_lifecycle.rs,178,227,"[""tests/support/live.rs:1-80"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/settings/mod.rs:43-70""]",A dashboard.toml with quota disabled spawns no collector; flipping enabled starts a native collector and publishes Current; flipping it off publishes Disabled with the off reason and terminates the collector process.,File changes not applied (quota never starts/stops) or a disabled collector left running.,3,3,3,4,75,80,78,A leftover collector keeps running native provider commands and holds resources; a missing one leaves quota stale (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/quota.rs:1-80).,"Asserts no pid file when off, Current plus a live pid when on, Disabled with QUOTA_OFF and the pid dead when off (tests/settings_lifecycle.rs:178-227).",Only test of the file-watch quota lifecycle; the account-change test drives settings instead (tests/settings_lifecycle.rs:390-464).,"Real binary, real file watch and a real native fixture process (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/quota.rs:1-80).",high,keep,The only file-watch start/stop collector test.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Asettings_lifecycle|account_change_moves_the_codex_and_claude_rows_without_restart|default""]","An 800ms settle, polling and a real fixture process",6.899,6.899,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1622 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,other-rust-integration-006,
