nextest|Test|ovrcr|operator%3A%3Aworker%3A%3Atests%3A%3Achatgpt_incomplete_text_is_not_completed_history|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr,lib,integration,operator::worker::tests::chatgpt_incomplete_text_is_not_completed_history,default,src/operator/worker.rs,1279,1281,"[""src/operator/worker.rs:281-300"", ""src/operator/worker.rs:637-774""]","Through the ChatGPT wire, an incomplete model turn (max_output_tokens) surfaces its visible partial text but must fail the stream: no completed history, exactly one provider request, no tool boundaries.","Accepting nonempty truncated text as a finished answer, saving it as model history, or retrying the turn, which would leave a half-answer recorded as complete.",3,4,2,4,75,80,78,A truncated answer stored as completed history misrepresents what the agent did and feeds a corrupt context into the next turn (worker.rs:281-300).,"Asserts partial text observed, one request only, no boundaries, not completed and the stream failing (worker.rs:1279-1281).",ChatGPT text variant of one shared helper; the Grok and tool shapes are separate executions with distinct clients (worker.rs:1283-1293).,"Real ChatGPT HTTP fixture, real rig stream and real finish-reason path (worker.rs:637-774).",high,keep,Provider-specific execution of a decisive gate.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr|operator%3A%3Aworker%3A%3Atests%3A%3Agrok_incomplete_text_is_not_completed_history|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr|operator%3A%3Aworker%3A%3Atests%3A%3Achatgpt_incomplete_tool_call_never_executes_bash_or_retries|default""]","[""SSE fixture"", ""five-second stream timeout""]",0.071,0.071,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:546 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,app-operator-001,independent-app-check-1
