nextest|Test|ovrcr|remote%3A%3Ahttp%3A%3Atests%3A%3Arefuses_oversized_and_chunked_bodies_and_folded_headers|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr,lib,unit,remote::http::tests::refuses_oversized_and_chunked_bodies_and_folded_headers,default,src/remote/http.rs,322,330,"[""src/remote/http.rs:119-200"", ""src/remote/http.rs:15-17"", ""src/remote/mod.rs:126-166""]","read_request refuses a Content-Length above MAX_BODY (64 KiB), refuses any Transfer-Encoding header, and refuses a header line beginning with a space or tab, before any of it reaches the gateway's routes.","Without the size guard one tailnet client could declare a huge Content-Length and occupy one of the 24 connection slots while the process grows its buffer; accepting Transfer-Encoding: chunked or a folded header reintroduces the framing disagreement with the fronting proxy that lets a second request slip past the login check in authorized(), i.e. request smuggling into the session control API.",3,3,3,4,75,80,78,"This is the input-hardening boundary in front of an API that can read every terminal and send keystrokes; a framing or memory regression threatens the availability and the access gate of the whole remote surface (src/remote/mod.rs:126-166), not just a display detail.","Three exact rejections sit on real boundaries: MAX_BODY + 1, a chunked request, and a folded header (src/remote/http.rs:322-330); MAX_BODY itself, a body longer than its declared Content-Length, and the error kind are not asserted.","No other test sends oversized, chunked or folded-header requests: tests/remote_web.rs:30-56 only writes well-formed GET/POST requests, so this failure mode has no other evidenced protection.","The production read_request is exercised directly, so the guards under test are the shipped ones (src/remote/http.rs:119-200); only the transport is a Cursor instead of a TcpStream.",high,keep,"The only protection for the gateway's framing and size guards, which are security-relevant and unreachable from the acceptance harness; it must stay.",[],"0.021s one hosted attempt; unit test in the ovrcr lib target, no sockets or child processes",0.021,0.021,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:558 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,app-remote-001,independent-shared-check-1
