python-unittest|Relocated%20macOS%20startup%20assets|native%2Fbridge%2Fcheck-installer.py%3A%3AInstallerTests|test_matching_designated_requirement_on_stdout_updates|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Relocated macOS startup assets,python-unittest,native/bridge/check-installer.py::InstallerTests,unittest,acceptance,test_matching_designated_requirement_on_stdout_updates,default,native/bridge/check-installer.py,431,432,"[""scripts/install-bridge.sh:100-157""]","An update whose existing and staged designated requirements match, read from stdout, succeeds with the full operation sequence and replaces the destination byte-for-byte.","Requirement comparison reading only one stream, so a matching stdout-only requirement reports a change and refuses a valid update.",3,4,2,4,75,80,78,"The real installer script decides what is signed, staged and published; a wrong decision ships an untrusted or broken app (scripts/install-bridge.sh:100-157).","Runs the real install-bridge.sh with the fake codesign/ditto dispatcher and asserts the exact operation sequence, exit code, artifact snapshots and absence of publication or staging.",This unittest targets 'test_matching_designated_requirement_on_stdout_updates' with its own fixture state; no other row stages the same authority state (native/bridge/check-installer.py:431-432).,The real shipping installer runs against a real private filesystem; only the external signer/copier/CLI tools are deterministic fakes that record their arguments.,high,keep,Grounded installer boundary with exact artifact/permission assertions; no equivalent coverage.,[],"[""real install-bridge.sh under a private HOME"", ""fake codesign/ditto dispatcher recording every call"", ""fixture snapshot and process-group checks""]",,,,,unmeasured,no per-method timing; unittest prints one aggregate: macOS-job.log:3631 'Ran 33 tests in 10.080s' (run 42429838269 job 128576086691 step 'Relocated macOS startup assets'),packaging-installers-001,
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|palette%3A%3Adeclining_the_save_does_not_remove_the_workspace|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::tui,integration,unit,palette::declining_the_save_does_not_remove_the_workspace,default,tests/tui/palette.rs,4019,4044,"[""crates/ovrcr-tui/src/dashboard/palette.rs:8560-8753""]",Esc on the save question sends nothing and removes the prompt; the workspace is not removed.,"A declined save still removing or discarding, or leaving an unanswerable prompt.",4,3,2,3,100,65,79,A decline that still removes loses uncommitted work irreversibly.,Empty outbox after Esc plus negative save-question text.,Decline safety complements the save-then-remove test.,Real dismissal and request gating.,high,keep,Keep: Empty outbox after Esc plus negative save-question text. Decline safety complements the save-then-remove test.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atui|palette%3A%3Adirty_workspace_removal_asks_to_save_then_removes_only_after_yes|default""]",[],0.029,0.029,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1882 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-dashboard-003,independent-dashboard-check-1
nextest|Test|ovrcr-protocol|agent%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aagent_report_all_variants_roundtrip_and_secret_redaction|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-protocol,lib,unit,agent::tests::agent_report_all_variants_roundtrip_and_secret_redaction,default,crates/ovrcr-protocol/src/agent.rs,1073,1092,"[""crates/ovrcr-protocol/src/agent.rs:303-307"", ""crates/ovrcr-protocol/src/agent.rs:896-1044"", ""crates/ovrcr-protocol/src/agent.rs:1045-1071""]","Every Request returned by request_fixtures (reserve, hello, status, five supervisor commands, six agent reports and ten cloud commands) and every Response in response_fixtures is bincode-framed and decoded equal, and each Debug rendering is asserted not to contain ""165"".","An encode/decode asymmetry for a newly appended variant or field, and a Debug implementation that renders AgentSecret lease or capability bytes, exposing credentials in logs.",4,3,2,3,100,65,79,Fixtures carry AgentSecret([165;32]) as lease and capability and raw cloud keys; a lost redaction exposes tokens that authenticate supervisors (agent.rs:303-307).,"Round-trip equality is exact for all fixtures, but the redaction check is a substring probe for one byte value, so a secret rendered in hex or another form escapes.","wire.rs:1992-2006 encodes the same fixtures to golden hex, so encoding is duplicated; the decode direction and broad Debug sweep are extra, and codec.rs:391-407 covers AgentReport capability redaction specifically.",Production framing and Debug implementations with real values.,high,keep,Broad secret-redaction and round-trip sweep with C=4; encoding overlap does not remove the redaction protection.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-protocol|wire%3A%3Awire_snapshot%3A%3Awire_encoding_matches_snapshot_for_protocol_version|default""]",about thirty bincode round trips,0.063,0.063,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2227 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,protocol-terminal-001,independent-protocol-check-1
nextest|Test|ovrcr-protocol|codec%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aagent_report_round_trip_and_redaction|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-protocol,lib,integration,codec::tests::agent_report_round_trip_and_redaction,default,crates/ovrcr-protocol/src/codec.rs,391,407,"[""crates/ovrcr-protocol/src/wire.rs:184-199"", ""crates/ovrcr-protocol/src/codec.rs:109-143""]","The AgentReport Debug output contains ""capability: [redacted]"", does not contain ""165"", and still contains ""Busy""; the report framed over a socket pair decodes equal.","AgentReport's custom Debug printing the 32-byte capability, the token that authenticates provider reports, or a manual Debug that drops other fields.",4,3,2,3,100,65,79,The capability authenticates agent reports (crates/ovrcr-protocol/src/wire.rs:184-199); printing it in logs lets another process report as that agent.,Asserts the exact rendered redaction marker and absence of the byte value plus a round trip; the negative probe is a substring check.,"Row 8 also probes ""165"" across fixtures, but only this test asserts the exact ""capability: [redacted]"" rendering.",Production Debug implementation and codec.,high,keep,C=4 credential redaction with the exact rendered form.,[],UnixStream pair,0.010,0.010,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2264 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,protocol-terminal-001,independent-protocol-check-1
node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_continuation_records.mjs|fork%20cannot%20inherit%20a%20copied%20pointer|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Extension tests,node-test,tests/pi_continuation_records.mjs,node,unit,fork cannot inherit a copied pointer,default,tests/pi_continuation_records.mjs,33,41,"[""src/ovrcr-delegation-continuation.mjs:1-99"", ""src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:240-255""]","A session_start with reason 'fork' makes no control call at all, resets with fresh=true, leaves state null and sets a gap saying copied or forked pointers grant no control.","If a forked or new session accepted the copied pointer, it could resume the original workflow and drive its children from a second context - two producers acting on one workflow.",4,4,1,3,100,65,79,"A copied pointer granting control is a wrong-owner action on a live workflow: the new session could launch, interrupt or resume children the original owner still controls (src/ovrcr-delegation-continuation.mjs:47-59).","It asserts zero control calls, the fresh reset, null state and the gap text (tests/pi_continuation_records.mjs:33-39), so both 'no authority' and 'no Server contact' are proven.","The production guard is one list membership test over both reasons (src/ovrcr-delegation-continuation.mjs:47-59), so the new variant exercises the same branch; the only distinct input is the reason string, which is why uniqueness is low. Keeping both is still warranted because a regression that dropped 'fork' from the list would be invisible to the other case.",The production restore() runs with a fixture pi and a fake call that would count any contact; the guard is inside the real function (src/ovrcr-delegation-continuation.mjs:47-59).,high,keep,Protects the copied-pointer authority barrier with a hard no-contact assertion; keep.,"[""node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_continuation_records.mjs|new%20cannot%20inherit%20a%20copied%20pointer|default""]",0.000161417s reported for this case; ordinary node:test case in the 'Extension tests' batch,0.000161417,0.000161417,1,0,hosted-single-run,TAP duration_ms 0.161417 at macOS-job.log:3873; run 42429838269 job 128576086691 step 'Extension tests',extensions-installed-pi-001,independent-extensions-check-1
node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_continuation_records.mjs|new%20cannot%20inherit%20a%20copied%20pointer|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Extension tests,node-test,tests/pi_continuation_records.mjs,node,unit,new cannot inherit a copied pointer,default,tests/pi_continuation_records.mjs,33,41,"[""src/ovrcr-delegation-continuation.mjs:1-99"", ""src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:240-255""]","A session_start with reason 'new' makes no control call at all, resets with fresh=true, leaves state null and sets a gap saying copied or forked pointers grant no control.","If a forked or new session accepted the copied pointer, it could resume the original workflow and drive its children from a second context - two producers acting on one workflow.",4,4,1,3,100,65,79,"A copied pointer granting control is a wrong-owner action on a live workflow: the new session could launch, interrupt or resume children the original owner still controls (src/ovrcr-delegation-continuation.mjs:47-59).","It asserts zero control calls, the fresh reset, null state and the gap text (tests/pi_continuation_records.mjs:33-39), so both 'no authority' and 'no Server contact' are proven.","The production guard is one list membership test over both reasons (src/ovrcr-delegation-continuation.mjs:47-59), so the fork variant exercises the same branch; the only distinct input is the reason string, which is why uniqueness is low. Keeping both is still warranted because a regression that dropped 'new' from the list would be invisible to the other case.",The production restore() runs with a fixture pi and a fake call that would count any contact; the guard is inside the real function (src/ovrcr-delegation-continuation.mjs:47-59).,high,keep,Protects the copied-pointer authority barrier with a hard no-contact assertion; keep.,"[""node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_continuation_records.mjs|fork%20cannot%20inherit%20a%20copied%20pointer|default""]",0.000139166s reported for this case; ordinary node:test case in the 'Extension tests' batch,0.000139166,0.000139166,1,0,hosted-single-run,TAP duration_ms 0.139166 at macOS-job.log:3879; run 42429838269 job 128576086691 step 'Extension tests',extensions-installed-pi-001,independent-extensions-check-1
node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_delegation_extension.mjs|prepare-only%20registered%20start%20reserves%20without%20effects%20and%20recovers%20after%20Prepare%20loss|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Extension tests,node-test,tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs,node,integration,prepare-only registered start reserves without effects and recovers after Prepare loss,default,tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs,644,673,"[""src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:171-350"", ""src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:472-656""]","With loss after, a prepare_only start returns Unknown with recovery_arguments {handle, prepare_only:true} and then Prepared once repeated, with no Launch/SendInitial, one Prepare per call with identical contract/auth, and a later prepare_only:false launching and sending exactly once.","If prepare_only ever reached Launch or SendInitial, a request that promised reservation would start a child and type the initial task; if the replay created a new contract, the reservation would not be idempotent.",4,4,1,3,100,65,79,"prepare_only is the reservation-only mode: a leaked Launch/SendInitial is a real child process and terminal input created by a call that explicitly promised no effects (src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:472-496, 326-330).","It asserts zero Launch/SendInitial rows before the explicit resume, Prepared with null identity, idempotent duplicate equality, one Prepare per call with identical contract and auth, the absent prepare_only marker and exact single Launch/SendInitial after resume (tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs:644-673).","Observationally redundant with the other lost-Prepare prepare-only case: the pre-effect recovery path calls Prepare again rather than Reconcile (src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:326-330), so 'before' and 'after' persistence produce the same Unknown-then-Prepared sequence and the same Prepare count. The distinct input is only where the stub persisted, which the assertions cannot see; the reservation invariants themselves are unique to the trio.","The real ovrcr_start callback, the real advance() and a real control child implement the Prepare state machine (src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:326-350, 472-513).",high,keep,The reservation-without-effects invariant is decisive and the three loss modes cover its recovery branches; keep.,"[""node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_delegation_extension.mjs|prepare-only%20registered%20start%20reserves%20without%20effects%20and%20recovers%20before%20Prepare%20loss|default""]",0.416s reported for this case; ordinary node:test case in the 'Extension tests' batch,0.416,0.416,1,0,hosted-single-run,TAP duration_ms 415.627958 at macOS-job.log:4011; run 42429838269 job 128576086691 step 'Extension tests',extensions-installed-pi-001,independent-extensions-check-1
node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_delegation_extension.mjs|prepare-only%20registered%20start%20reserves%20without%20effects%20and%20recovers%20before%20Prepare%20loss|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Extension tests,node-test,tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs,node,integration,prepare-only registered start reserves without effects and recovers before Prepare loss,default,tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs,644,673,"[""src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:171-350"", ""src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:472-656""]","With loss before, a prepare_only start returns Unknown with recovery_arguments {handle, prepare_only:true} and then Prepared once repeated, with no Launch/SendInitial, one Prepare per call with identical contract/auth, and a later prepare_only:false launching and sending exactly once.","If prepare_only ever reached Launch or SendInitial, a request that promised reservation would start a child and type the initial task; if the replay created a new contract, the reservation would not be idempotent.",4,4,1,3,100,65,79,"prepare_only is the reservation-only mode: a leaked Launch/SendInitial is a real child process and terminal input created by a call that explicitly promised no effects (src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:472-496, 326-330).","It asserts zero Launch/SendInitial rows before the explicit resume, Prepared with null identity, idempotent duplicate equality, one Prepare per call with identical contract and auth, the absent prepare_only marker and exact single Launch/SendInitial after resume (tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs:644-673).","Distinct from the sibling lost-Prepare execution: this row loses the record before Prepare, so recovery resumes from the pre-Prepare point, while the sibling loses it after Prepare and resumes from the recorded effect (tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs:644-673). The distinction is narrow and the sibling carries the primary coverage, so uniqueness stays 1.","The real ovrcr_start callback, the real advance() and a real control child implement the Prepare state machine (src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:326-350, 472-513).",high,keep,"Kept rather than consolidated: both bodies run the same loop at tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs:644-673 through the shared host at tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs:607-642, but they drive it with loss='before' versus loss='after', and the only branch difference is the stub's persistence point at tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs:623-626 (the assignment is written only for 'after', line 625), so this row recovers from an unprepared Server state while its 'after' sibling recovers from an already-persisted assignment - neither execution subsumes the other. A future consolidation could keep only the persisted case if the pre-effect recovery path were proven to hold the same contract, but until then keeping both preserves the only coverage of each recovery branch; the C=4 reservation invariant is asserted by both.","[""node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_delegation_extension.mjs|prepare-only%20registered%20start%20reserves%20without%20effects%20and%20recovers%20after%20Prepare%20loss|default""]",0.441s reported for this case; ordinary node:test case in the 'Extension tests' batch,0.441,0.441,1,0,hosted-single-run,TAP duration_ms 441.169791 at macOS-job.log:4005; run 42429838269 job 128576086691 step 'Extension tests',extensions-installed-pi-001,independent-extensions-check-1
