nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclaude_quota_probe|claude_probe_does_not_run_before_a_dashboard_attaches|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::claude_quota_probe,integration,acceptance,claude_probe_does_not_run_before_a_dashboard_attaches,default,tests/claude_quota_probe.rs,199,234,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/quota_probe.rs:100-143"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/quota_probe.rs:225-300"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/claude_allowance.rs:150-175""]","With the probe enabled, waits 400 ms and asserts no probe ran, then attaches a dashboard and asserts a Current Probe-sourced row appears with exactly one probe whose log shows model haiku, permission mode dontAsk, the fixed prompt, `--setting-sources`, `--tools`, a settings document containing only statusLine (no hooks, zero entries), and a dead probe process with checked_unix_ms None.","Probing before a dashboard is attached (a hidden provider process with no observer), or launching Claude with the user's settings/hooks, wrong flags, more than one probe, or leaving the process alive.",3,4,3,3,75,85,81,"The attach gate bounds when a hidden provider process may run, and the argv contract is what keeps the probe from loading user hooks or granting tools.","The no-probe wait, exact probe count, per-argument log assertions, settings-document content and process liveness are all asserted.",Only row asserting the probe argv/settings contract and the attach gate.,"Real server, real PTY-launched provider fixture and real probe socket.",high,keep,Precise launch-contract assertions that protect both consent timing and provider isolation; keep.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclaude_quota_probe|claude_probe_off_spawns_nothing_and_waits_for_a_managed_session|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aclaude_quota_probe|claude_probe_output_does_not_contain_a_fixture_credential|default""]","[""server spawn and PTY provider"", ""400 ms pre-attach wait"", ""2.97 s observed""]",2.970,2.970,1,0,hosted-singl