y and replacement negatives; keep.,[],"[""scripted Codex host"", ""real managed PTY"", ""fault-free replay via proxy originals""]",4.707,4.707,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1062 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-delegation-001,independent-delegation-check-1
