egation.rs:2031-2035.","Real server flows and durable files, but legacy state is constructed by direct SQLite UPDATE and a Node sha256 helper; the public reconcile/recover path is genuine; real boundary at tests/pi_delegation.rs:1509-1600.",high,keep,The only byte-level legacy contract migration proof in the suite; unit tests cover fields but not preserved bytes across a version advance.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation%3A%3Atests%3A%3Alegacy_dispatch_never_infers_unsent_from_missing_receipts|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation%3A%3Acontrol%3A%3Atests%3A%3Alegacy_metadata_preserves_receipt_digests_without_inventing_initial_authority|default""]","[""direct SQLite mutation of registry rows"", ""node sha256 subprocess"", ""real managed child PTY"", ""file polling""]",7.071,7.071,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1298 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-delegation-001,
