tion with a real reader; unique and high value.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-tui|dashboard%3A%3Aevent_loop%3A%3Aoperator_loop_tests%3A%3Aoperator_quick_production_dispatch_keeps_key_paste_mouse_resize_off_pty|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr-tui|dashboard%3A%3Aoperator%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aconcurrent_histories_follow_ids_through_a_terminal_b_a_navigation|default""]","[""spawned reader thread"", ""UnixStream::pair"", ""vt100 parser"", ""2 s read timeouts"", ""multiple full-frame renders""]",0.528,0.528,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2993 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,tui-library-002,
