e%2Fbridge%2Fcheck-installer.py%3A%3AInstallerTests|test_production_still_refuses_ad_hoc_identity|default""]",copies a payload tree; spawns install-bridge.sh subprocess,,,,,unmeasured,suite aggregate only: macOS-job.log:3644 (28 checks) '28 relocated startup payload checks passed; pinned entitlement SHA256 c479446ccc1537f8b64d0bc2c4a7b5a64f80753659d0cdf5450c2927df8eb29b; no install or app launch' (run 42429838269 job 128576086691 step 'Relocated macOS startup assets'),packaging-installers-002,independent-report-check-2
