r%3A%3Abin%2Fovrcr|cli%3A%3Aagent_setup%3A%3Atests%3A%3Adoctor_health_reason_exposes_known_codes_and_redacts_arbitrary_text|default""]","[""five doctor processes with a Unix-socket server thread each"", ""temp HOME per case""]",0.084,0.084,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:688 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,other-rust-integration-001,
