nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Api_delegation|assignment_control%3A%3Aaccepted_parent_followup_never_replays_after_passive_human_control_aba|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::pi_delegation,integration,acceptance,assignment_control::accepted_parent_followup_never_replays_after_passive_human_control_aba,default,tests/pi_delegation/control.rs,354,487,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_control.rs:132-254"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_control.rs:329-424""]","Reserves a followup contract version, drops the reply after files, then performs a passive human takeover/return/confirm ABA; asserts the accepted followup becomes Rejected with the same identity/version, later continuations skip the reserved version and contract, execution attempts stay 1, reserved files remain byte-identical, and version 2 stays an uncollectable hole.","A passive human-control ABA replaying a previously accepted followup, reusing the reserved version, or erasing execution proof.",3,4,3,4,75,90,84,"A passive human-control ABA replaying a previously accepted followup, reusing the reserved version, or erasing execution proof. The consequence is enforced at crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_control.rs:132-254.","The decisive assertion is the 'immutable reserved version' check at tests/pi_delegation/control.rs:420-423, which rejects the wrong outcome rather than smoke-testing.","Compared with nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Api_delegation|assignment_control%3A%3Apublic_assignment_human_takeover_return_fences_generics_and_preserves_history|default at tests/pi_delegation/control.rs:168-350, which does not exercise this boundary; the distinguishing assertion here is at tests/pi_delegation/control.rs:420-423.","The real boundary is constructed by tests/pi_delegation/control.rs:31-100 (fixture spawns the binary server and managed PTY/provider gates), with no stand-in for the subject.",high,keep,"Grounded coverage of a durable authority, evidence, or d