ile/control; real boundary at tests/pi_delegation.rs:1509-1600.",high,keep,Core idempotent-recovery matrix with precise duplicate-effect negative assertions; unique combination coverage.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Api_delegation|public_dispatch_partial_and_uncertain_input_is_never_replayed|default""]","[""fault proxy frame loss"", ""real managed child PTY"", ""6-case operation/loss matrix""]",29.755,29.755,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1297 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-delegation-001,
