,Unique corruption-plus-reopen state-preservation coverage; the run replacement boundary is not exercised elsewhere.,[],"[""real managed child PTY"", ""kill/reopen protocol calls"", ""result file corruption fixture""]",5.106,5.106,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1293 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-delegation-001,
