nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aretained_sessions|attached_agent_natural_exit_stays_explicit_after_a_verified_reboot|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::retained_sessions,integration,acceptance,attached_agent_natural_exit_stays_explicit_after_a_verified_reboot,default,tests/retained_sessions.rs,1712,1779,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/retained.rs:253-280"", ""tests/support/live.rs:1-80""]","An attached Claude agent that exits naturally, then loses its post-exit shell, is not recoverable after a reboot once its boot id shows the exit was seen; RecoverSession returns an Error and no process group starts.","A natural exit misread as interrupted work after reboot, so the server relaunches an agent the user chose to finish.",3,4,3,4,75,90,84,"Re-launching an agent after a clean, observed exit repeats the user's completed work and can re-run side effects (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/retained.rs:253-280).","Sets the retained record's boot id back to the prior boot, restarts the fixture and asserts RecoverSession errors and no session groups exist; it also proves the earlier attach/exit path reached exited (tests/retained_sessions.rs:1712-1779).","The natural-exit-versus-reboot branch is unique; the sibling recovery tests cover crash, ownership and replay in different records (tests/retained_sessions.rs).","Real compiled binary, real database, real agent fixture and a real reboot simulation; the full OS/process boundary is the subject (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/retained.rs:253-280).",high,keep,Covers the post-reboot natural-exit disposition that no sibling test asserts.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aretained_sessions|extension_conversations_switch_and_survive_repeated_restart|default""]","Server restarts, a SQLite edit and a real agent fixture process",8.397,8.397,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1417 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,other-rust-integration-006,
