nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aretained_sessions|full_capacity_records_automatic_failure_without_retrying_when_a_slot_opens|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::retained_sessions,integration,acceptance,full_capacity_records_automatic_failure_without_retrying_when_a_slot_opens,default,tests/retained_sessions.rs,1782,1846,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/retained.rs:490-520"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/mod.rs:3000-3060""]","With all 50 session slots taken, an automatic recovery is refused and the retained row records a visible failure; freeing a slot does not retry it, and only an explicit ReopenSession relaunches.","Capacity refusal silently retried on the next slot, or a refusal leaving the row without a visible Retry state.",3,4,3,4,75,90,84,The 50-session cap is a product guarantee; a retry loop or a silent failure breaks it and can launch a process the user did not choose (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/retained.rs:500-515).,"Fills exactly 50 slots, asserts the Error, the row's recovery.failure, a second automatic attempt still failing after a kill, then an explicit reopen succeeding (tests/retained_sessions.rs:1782-1846).",The capacity-refusal-then-no-auto-retry branch is unique; other retention tests never fill the cap (tests/retained_sessions.rs).,"Real binary, 50 real session processes and the real database; the cap is exercised at the real boundary (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/mod.rs:3000-3050).",high,keep,Only test of automatic recovery under a full session table.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aretained_sessions|automatic_recovery_failure_requires_explicit_retry_even_after_reconnect|default""]",Fifty spawned shells plus repeated restart and recovery attempts,12.749,12.749,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1429 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,other-rust-integration-006,
