nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|agent_admission_explicit_resume_preserves_argv_and_collects_conversation_usage|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::server_lifecycle,integration,acceptance,agent_admission_explicit_resume_preserves_argv_and_collects_conversation_usage,default,tests/server_lifecycle.rs,9356,9358,"[""src/report/admission.rs:88-190"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/session/reporting.rs:88-205""]","An `agent run --provider claude` with --resume and a known conversation id: the native argv is preserved with --resume, uuid, --agent, empty setting-sources, a spaced --settings value and --strict-mcp-config plus auto-trust; a matching resume root binds; pre-invocation transcript usage (10 in/1 out) is collected as conversation-scope metrics; a resumed turn then counts 60/6 once.","Resume could be launched with rewritten argv, or the resumed conversation could bind on a non-matching source and import the wrong transcript usage.",3,4,3,4,75,90,84,Wrong argv or wrong conversation binding resumes the user in a different session and misstates usage (src/report/admission.rs:88-190).,"Asserts the exact native argv file, refused wrong/child/missing-source callbacks, and exact metric totals after the growth step (tests/server_lifecycle.rs:9440-9540).",Only row asserting conversation-scope usage collection on an explicit resume with a real transcript (tests/server_lifecycle.rs:9356-9358).,"Real native fixture, real transcript JSONL and real reporting socket (tests/server_lifecycle.rs:9370-9400).",high,keep,Grounded resume/argv/usage coverage with exact expected values.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|agent_admission_short_resume_on_2_1_268_preserves_argv_and_lifecycle|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|claude_interrupted_resume_keeps_reporting_healthy_and_delivers_new_ready|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|agent_admission_later_patch_preserves_resume_identity_and_lifecycle|default