nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|claude_metrics_collector_loss_propagates_while_native_stays_usable|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::server_lifecycle,integration,acceptance,claude_metrics_collector_loss_propagates_while_native_stays_usable,default,tests/server_lifecycle.rs,10378,10380,"[""src/report/claude_metrics.rs:188-350"", ""src/report/admission.rs:600-633"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/session/reporting.rs:640-656""]","With kill_collector=true, killing the native collector drives health to collector_unavailable while the session stays Running and the binding holds; a later statusline still answers, and native exit finalizes Partial with incomplete_final_accounting.","Collector loss could either stop the session or leave the reporter claiming Connected with frozen metrics, hiding that final accounting is incomplete.",3,4,3,4,75,90,84,"Silently frozen usage after collector death reports stale numbers as live, a major accounting failure (src/report/admission.rs:600-633 source health).","Asserts collector_unavailable reason with Running phase, then final Partial coverage with a specific finalize reason (tests/server_lifecycle.rs:10640-10680, :10760-10790).",Distinct collector-death boundary; the freeze and lost-ack variants exercise different finalize reasons (tests/server_lifecycle.rs:10374-10380).,Real collector process group killed through the production kill-collector path with real metrics (tests/server_lifecycle.rs:10630-10670).,high,keep,Grounded failure-propagation coverage with a distinct finalize reason.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|claude_metrics_unsupported_fork_freezes_components_and_prevents_reader_reopening|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|claude_metrics_route_collects_partial_usage_and_finalizes_native_exit|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|claude_metrics_finalization_recovers_original_receipt_after_lost_ack|default""]","[""real native collector process"", ""kill-collector command"", ""metrics polling""]",3.855,3.855,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1460 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,lifecycle-terminal-acceptance-002,
