nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|concurrent_terminal_sends_are_serialized_as_complete_pastes|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::server_lifecycle,integration,integration,concurrent_terminal_sends_are_serialized_as_complete_pastes,default,tests/server_lifecycle.rs,5295,5409,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/session/mod.rs:1406-1420"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/connections.rs:510-560""]","Two connections concurrently SendTerminal ""AA\nA"" and ""BB\nB"" to a raw-mode session that reads 34 bytes and hex-dumps them; the dump contains both complete bracketed-paste sequences in one order or the other, never interleaved.","Concurrent sends could interleave bytes inside a paste, so the child receives a corrupted command line (wrong keystrokes executed).",3,4,3,4,75,90,84,Interleaved paste bytes corrupt terminal input that the shell then executes (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/session/mod.rs:1406-1420).,Decisive byte-sequence assertion that rejects any interleaving while permitting either serial order (tests/server_lifecycle.rs:5370-5385).,Only row asserting atomicity of concurrent paste writes (tests/server_lifecycle.rs:5295-5409).,Real PTY in raw mode with the child hex-dumping exactly the received bytes (tests/server_lifecycle.rs:5300-5310).,high,keep,Decisive serialization assertion on the real PTY byte stream.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Aserver_lifecycle|backpressured_input_and_send_do_not_block_inspect_or_kill|default""]","[""barrier-synchronized sender threads"", ""raw-mode PTY with dd byte capture"", ""hex dump parsing""]",3.530,3.530,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1484 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,lifecycle-terminal-acceptance-001,
