nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation%3A%3Aarchive%3A%3Atests%3A%3Arejected_continuation_candidates_preserve_serialized_original_for_later_owner|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime,lib,unit,server::delegation::archive::tests::rejected_continuation_candidates_preserve_serialized_original_for_later_owner,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs,1052,1120,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:130-160"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:36-160""]","Six invalid continuation candidates (separately persisted admission, foreign predecessor, changed predecessor epoch, replacement run, unbounded future owner, unretired barrier) are each refused when appended to the retained bytes, and every refusal leaves the retained record and original receipt serialized byte-identically; a later valid owner still files, leaving two receipts.","A rejected continuation candidate mutating the retained record (replacing the original receipt or its serialized bytes), so the protected slot is consumed by a failed attempt and the real owner can no longer file.",3,4,3,4,75,90,84,Preserving the serialized original is what keeps one owner's failed attempt from destroying another's durable archive evidence (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:130-160).,"Per-label error plus byte-equality of retained archive_receipts[0] and the whole record (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:1092-1101), then the later valid candidate succeeds with two receipts and the original receipt intact (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:1111-1116).","The branch at crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:130-160: distinct from nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation%3A%3Aarchive%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aserialized_near_full_records_protect_slots_and_bytes_until_their_own_continuation|default: that proves slot/byte accounting, this proves no rejected candidate rewrites the retained bytes.","Every attempt starts from a fresh decode of the original bytes, so the assertion is on the persisted representation (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:952-960).",high,keep,Six labelled refusals with byte-identical preservation and a later success.,[],"[""one nextest process; six generated candidates""]",0.268,0.268,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2518 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-delegation-001,independent-runtime-delegation-check-1
nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation%3A%3Aarchive%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aserialized_near_full_records_protect_slots_and_bytes_until_their_own_continuation|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime,lib,unit,server::delegation::archive::tests::serialized_near_full_records_protect_slots_and_bytes_until_their_own_continuation,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs,962,1049,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:36-160"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:171-220""]","On 245000-byte serialized records, neither spare row bytes nor a spare operation slot can spend the protected continuation reservation: slot-only pressure is refused with 'operation storage', byte-only pressure with 'byte storage', and only the receipt whose predecessor is the exact stopped original files the archive, consumes its slot and leaves the original receipt unchanged.","A writer that authorises the archive from plain serialized size or free operation count, letting one owner consume the slot/bytes reserved for the original's continuation and leaving the archive unfileable.",3,4,3,4,75,90,84,This is the atomic filing invariant for durable archive receipts: two resources must each keep their own reserved slot and bytes (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:130-160).,"Four independent refusals/acceptances with distinct error kinds (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:976-1024), completion assertions on slot count and size (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:1021-1031), replay true and a post-completion control op refused (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:1024-1031), plus both originals byte-identical at the end.","The branch at crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:36-160: the most complete capacity case: nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation%3A%3Aarchive%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aarchive_reserves_last_slot_until_atomic_successful_continuation|default, nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation%3A%3Aarchive%3A%3Atests%3A%3Astop_certification_spends_original_outcome_headroom_without_spending_continuation_bytes|default and nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation%3A%3Aarchive%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aarchive_reserves_bytes_against_later_record_writes_and_future_owner|default each isolate one dimension; this one shows both and the completion.","Real 245000-byte serialized fixtures decoded back into Records, exercising the production accounting on the persisted size (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_archive.rs:890-960).",high,keep,Decisive two-dimensional capacity invariant on serialized boundary records.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation%3A%3Aarchive%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aarchive_reserves_last_slot_until_atomic_successful_continuation|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation%3A%3Aarchive%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aarchive_reserves_bytes_against_later_record_writes_and_future_owner|default""]","[""one nextest process; two 245000-byte fixtures""]",0.144,0.144,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2514 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-delegation-001,independent-runtime-delegation-check-1
