nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation%3A%3Atests%3A%3Aexecution_accounting_uses_receipts_and_never_resource_absence|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime,lib,integration,server::delegation::tests::execution_accounting_uses_receipts_and_never_resource_absence,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation.rs,3233,3391,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation.rs:168-260"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation.rs:562-660""]","Execution accounting is derived from receipts and durable lineage, never from resource absence: twenty-four named situations assert an exact Some(count) or None, including raw Prepared (0), unknown launch without a row (1), applied launch (1), refusals without proof (None), refusals with preflight proof (0), zero contradicting unknown input (None), duplicate receipts (None) and contradictory Applied binding (None).","Treating a refused or unknown dispatch as never having consumed an attempt (or vice versa), which either exceeds the execution budget or strands the assignment as permanently spent.",3,4,3,4,75,90,84,This is the budget/ownership proof used before another child launch; both over- and under-counting change who may run (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation.rs:168-260).,"Each case asserts an exact expected value (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation.rs:3384-3386) and re-asserts it after upgrade_legacy, so a defect that only appears at migration is also rejected.",The branch at crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation.rs:168-260: overlaps nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation%3A%3Atests%3A%3Apending_initial_binding_preserves_only_valid_known_accounting|default on receipt shape but covers refusal/preflight/capacity states that case never builds.,"Runs the production spent_execution_attempts and upgrade_legacy directly; every case mutates real Record fields and real receipt digests (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation.rs:168-260, crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation.rs:562-660).",high,keep,"Twenty-one exact expectations, no timing dependence.",[],"[""one nextest process; 21 generated cases""]",0.140,0.140,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2548 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-delegation-001,independent-runtime-delegation-check-1
