legation%3A%3Atests%3A%3Apending_initial_binding_preserves_only_valid_known_accounting|default start from records that already carry receipts.,Calls production Record::upgrade_legacy/receipt/intent on a record whose contract bytes are read from a real temp directory (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation.rs:2706-2726).,high,keep,Exact positive and negative legacy-mapping assertions; 0.050 s single attempt.,[],"[""one nextest process; six status cases plus two contradictory fixtures; 0.050 s first attempt""]",0.050,0.050,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2547 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-delegation-001,independent-runtime-delegation-check-1
