per that constructs the shapes the algorithm must reject (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation.rs:3062-3086).,high,keep,Strongest accounting matrix in the shard: four valid and eighteen invalid combinations.,[],"[""one nextest process; 22 generated cases""]",0.021,0.021,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2550 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-delegation-001,
