ation.rs:222-268 over a record that survives a real serde roundtrip (the persisted shape), not a reimplementation of the rule.",high,keep,Covers the reserved-gap failure mode with roundtrip and eleven negatives.,[],"[""one nextest process; 11 generated corruptions""]",0.019,0.019,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2551 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-delegation-001,
