 asserts the absent-file precondition and the commit refusal.,[],"[""one nextest process; real temp files""]",0.018,0.018,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2556 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-delegation-001,independent-runtime-delegation-check-1
