nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acursor_cloud|managed_cloud_observation_accepts_opaque_nonconsecutive_stream_scoped_tokens|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::cursor_cloud,integration,acceptance,managed_cloud_observation_accepts_opaque_nonconsecutive_stream_scoped_tokens,default,tests/cursor_cloud.rs,1286,1358,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/cursor_cloud/run.rs:82-100"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/cursor_cloud/run.rs:47-82""]","Uses opaque stream-scoped offsets and a replayed completion; asserts one Ready line, one `Inspecting selected source.` line, observe requests with after [null, ""0""], saved send token ""0"" revision 2 and observe token ""observe/result"" revision 6.",The observer assuming offsets are consecutive integers (dropping opaque tokens) or deduplicating equal content so a real event is lost.,3,4,4,3,75,95,87,Opaque tokens are the bridge's only cursor representation; integer assumptions break observation and can lose the completion.,"The exact opaque token strings, after values and revisions are persisted-state assertions, not text matches.",Only opaque-token test with a replayed completion.,Real server/SQLite and scripted bridge.,high,keep,Nonconsecutive-token handling with persisted cursors; keep.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acursor_cloud|managed_same_bridge_observe_preserves_distinct_equal_content_events|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acursor_cloud|managed_cloud_observe_skips_an_empty_keepalive_without_advancing_its_cursor|default""]","[""PTY session"", ""SQLite read"", ""0.40 s observed""]",6.412,6.412,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:879 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,other-rust-integration-003,
