nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acursor_cloud|managed_creation_crashes_retain_original_operation_and_require_explicit_discard|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::cursor_cloud,integration,acceptance,managed_creation_crashes_retain_original_operation_and_require_explicit_discard,default,tests/cursor_cloud.rs,609,768,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/cursor_cloud.rs:412-436"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/retained.rs:1-120""]","For four crash boundaries (before dispatch, after create, after reply, after ack), asserts the offline retained recovery text, no auto-recovery, the exact CreateAgent/Send counts, the surviving creation-payload count, restart persistence of the same description, and that Discard/Delete are refused while the session is live/archived in the wrong order before succeeding.","A crash losing the original operation (so the remote effect becomes unreplayable/uncertain), auto-recovering without a claim, or discarding payloads before the durable state permits it.",3,4,4,3,75,95,87,"Crash boundaries around a remote create are the durability core: losing the intent orphans a possibly-created agent, and premature discard destroys the only evidence.","Four boundaries with per-boundary payload and RPC counts, an offline read, a restart re-read, and an ordering matrix for Discard/Delete.",Only crash-boundary matrix with restart and discard ordering.,"Real server, SQLite and scripted bridge; restart is real.",high,keep,Durable-uncertainty contract with restart evidence; keep.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acursor_cloud|managed_creation_discard_serializes_against_dispatch_and_late_receipt|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acursor_cloud|managed_creation_storage_failures_permit_only_durably_claimed_effects|default""]","[""four restarts"", ""SQLite reads"", ""bridge fixture"", ""0.42 s observed""]",39.866,39.866,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:887 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,other-rust-integration-003,independent-integration-check-1
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acursor_cloud|managed_creation_storage_failures_permit_only_durably_claimed_effects|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::cursor_cloud,integration,acceptance,managed_creation_storage_failures_permit_only_durably_claimed_effects,default,tests/cursor_cloud.rs,851,984,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/cursor_cloud.rs:412-436"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/retained.rs:600-700""]","Installs SQLite triggers or corrupts/redirects the creation payload for six storage-fault modes, then asserts the exact CreateAgent count permitted by the claimed state, no Send, no credential or bearer text in stored metadata, and the receipt/closed fields reflecting the failure.","Dispatching a remote CreateAgent without a durable claim, or storing a secret in metadata while reporting a storage failure.",3,4,4,3,75,95,87,The claim-before-dispatch rule is what makes a remote effect recoverable after a storage fault; violating it can create an untracked remote agent.,Six fault modes with per-mode RPC counts and raw metadata scans for a secret and the specific null/false markers.,Only storage-fault creation matrix.,"Real SQLite triggers, payload corruption and a scripted bridge.",high,keep,Claim-vs-effect matrix with secret scans; keep.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acursor_cloud|managed_creation_crashes_retain_original_operation_and_require_explicit_discard|default"", ""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Acursor_cloud|managed_send_storage_faults_never_dispatch_without_claim_or_retire_unreceipted_payload|default""]","[""six fixtures with DB triggers"", ""0.42 s observed""]",27.911,27.911,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:890 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,other-rust-integration-003,independent-integration-check-1
