utable is scripted because no child should start; real boundary at tests/pi_delegation/codex.rs:25-140.",high,keep,Exhaustive no-effect proof across real git and durable state; unique and high value.,[],"[""real git branch/worktree inspection"", ""SQLite delegation count"", ""scripted Codex host""]",4.263,4.263,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1059 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-delegation-001,independent-delegation-check-1
