ion, real PTY; real boundary at tests/pi_delegation.rs:1509-1600.",high,keep,Strongest candidate-authentication boundary in the shard; keep.,[],"[""acceptance-diagnostics feature"", ""fault injection after candidate"", ""direct SQLite metadata read""]",19.394,19.394,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1084 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-delegation-001,
