ranscript"", ""many statusline callbacks"", ""metrics polling""]",4.157,4.157,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1465 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,lifecycle-terminal-acceptance-001,
