node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_delegation_extension.mjs|original%20intent%20recovers%20a%20lost%20Prepare%20after%20persistence|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Extension tests,node-test,tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs,node,integration,original intent recovers a lost Prepare after persistence,default,tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs,204,292,"[""src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:171-350"", ""src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:472-656""]","A lost Prepare reply (after the assignment was persisted) returns dispatch/transport Unknown with no receipts; replaying with only the handle recovers Applied with session 41, exactly one Launch and one SendInitial, a symlinked intent and an intent that grows past its stat are both Refused without contacting the Server, and the read budget stops at 262145 bytes.","If the extension replayed a fresh Prepare/Launch after an unknown outcome, the child would be launched or fed twice; if a symlink or a growing file could serve as intent, foreign bytes could authorize a launch.",4,4,3,3,100,85,91,"Duplicate launch or initial input is a destructive wrong-target action on a child session, and intent-file substitution would let non-owned bytes act as authority (src/ovrcr-pi-runtime.ts:274-350).","It asserts the Unknown classification with no receipts, the recovered Applied identity, exact Launch/SendInitial counts, symlink refusal with an unchanged call count, and the precise 262145-byte read bound under a file that grows after stat (tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs:204-292).","The two rows share a body but differ in whether the assignment was persisted before the reply was lost, which selects the Reconcile-found versus NotFound branch in advance(); each is a distinct recovery path.","The real tools, the real private-intent files and a real control child process run; the Server is stubbed at its production CLI boundary (tests/pi_delegation_extension.mjs:214-262).",high,keep,Decisive coverage of lost-Prepare recovery and intent-bounded authority; keep.,"[""node-test|Extension%20tests|tests%2Fpi_delegation_extension.mjs|original%20intent%20recovers%20a%20lost%20Prepare%20before%20persistence|default""]",0.359s reported for this case; ordinary node:test case in the 'Extension tests' batch,0.359,0.359,1,0,hosted-single-run,TAP duration_ms 358.942625 at macOS-job.log:3951; run 42429838269 job 128576086691 step 'Extension tests',extensions-installed-pi-001,independent-extensions-check-1
