nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atask_execution|git_run_cleanup_rejects_a_workspace_that_preexisted_preparation|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::task_execution,integration,acceptance,git_run_cleanup_rejects_a_workspace_that_preexisted_preparation,default,tests/task_execution.rs,656,695,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/mod.rs:2641-2670"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/git.rs:397-437""]","For two branch shapes, a run that failed because its folder was already an unrelated workspace cannot clean that folder; the unrelated worktree and its branch survive, while the run's own branch folder is cleanable.",Cleanup deleting another workspace's checkout that happens to share the run's folder name.,4,4,3,4,100,90,94,"The cleanup would delete a worktree the task never created, destroying another workspace's files (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/mod.rs:2641-2670).","Asserts the duplicate-workspace run failure, the clean's success depending on folder identity, the surviving folder, workspace lookup and branch refs (tests/task_execution.rs:656-695).",The pre-existing-workspace cleanup guard is unique; the replacement test covers the after-cleanup case (tests/task_execution.rs:742-796).,"Real binary, real git worktrees and a real unrelated workspace (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/mod.rs:2641-2670).",high,keep,Pins cleanup ownership of pre-existing folders.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atask_execution|git_run_cleanup_rejects_a_replacement_workspace_after_cleanup|default""]",Two branch shapes with real worktrees,8.273,8.273,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1624 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,other-rust-integration-006,independent-integration-final-check-1
nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atask_execution|git_runs_fetch_remote_head_keep_files_and_preserve_branches_on_cleanup|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::task_execution,integration,acceptance,git_runs_fetch_remote_head_keep_files_and_preserve_branches_on_cleanup,default,tests/task_execution.rs,335,460,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/git.rs:966-1010"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/task_runner.rs:40-70""]","A git task fetches the remote head (base_commit equals the fresh remote sha), runs in a worktree with the latest files, does not start a shell, refuses project deletion while the task depends on it, refuses dirty cleanup, and preserves the run branch after a clean removal; a credential-bearing remote is rejected without being written.","Running against a stale local commit, persisting a credentialed remote URL, deleting the branch, or cleaning a dirty worktree.",4,4,3,4,100,90,94,"The credential-bearing remote would leak a secret into task state, and a wrong base commit runs unattended work on the wrong code (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/git.rs:966-1010).","Asserts the reject and secret absence, the exact remote sha and file, the empty terminal list, dirty-clean refusal, branch presence after cleanup and the Succeeded status (tests/task_execution.rs:335-460).","The git-task end-to-end (fetch, worktree, branch, cleanup) is unique (tests/task_execution.rs:656-796 covers cleanup guards).","Real git remote, real worktrees, real binary and files (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/git.rs:966-1010).",high,keep,The main git-task integration test.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Atask_execution|git_run_cleanup_rejects_a_replacement_workspace_after_cleanup|default""]","A bare remote, clones, a worktree and a full run",5.410,5.410,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1625 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,other-rust-integration-006,independent-integration-final-check-1
