nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime%3A%3Adelegation_fallback_files|delegation_files%3A%3Aread_tests%3A%3Acheckout_read_is_bounded_relative_and_never_follows_links|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr-runtime::delegation_fallback_files,integration,integration,delegation_files::read_tests::checkout_read_is_bounded_relative_and_never_follows_links,default,crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_files.rs,236,279,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_files.rs:33-60"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_files.rs:172-230""]","Identical to the delegation_files read_tests body: bounded relative reads under the checkout succeed, while traversal, absolute, dot-segment, missing, directory, symlink, hardlink, oversized and NUL paths are rejected and still_at fails after the directory is replaced.","A child or tool reading outside its checkout through .., an absolute path, a symlink or a hardlink, exposing the parent's filesystem through the delegated read path.",4,4,3,4,100,90,94,"Same C=4 path-escape/privacy boundary as the retained execution: the checkout is the only file scope a delegated child is granted (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_files.rs:33-60, crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_files.rs:172-230).","Same thirteen negative names plus the positive nested read and rename check (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_files.rs:246-278), executed as a second binary-level run of the same assertions.","This is the lexicographically smallest execution of the identical body (delegation_files.rs:236-279 via #[path] include), so it is the retained representative for the pair and duplicates nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation_files%3A%3Aread_tests%3A%3Acheckout_read_is_bounded_relative_and_never_follows_links|default exactly.",Real filesystem through the production ReadTree open/read/still_at (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_files.rs:172-230).,high,keep,Retained representative of the identical-body pair; the C=4 invariant is asserted verbatim here.,"[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime|server%3A%3Adelegation_files%3A%3Aread_tests%3A%3Acheckout_read_is_bounded_relative_and_never_follows_links|default""]","[""one nextest process; second binary execution of the same body""]",0.016,0.016,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2856 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-delegation-001,independent-runtime-delegation-check-1
