ord_validation_preserves_only_complete_legacy_or_current_progress|default""]",three registries with inserted rows and payload files,0.120,0.120,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2440 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-storage-settings-tasks-002,independent-storage-check-1
