nk, an oversized file and a real rename (crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_files.rs:172-230).",high,consolidate,"Consolidate with the retained representative nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime%3A%3Adelegation_fallback_files|delegation_files%3A%3Aread_tests%3A%3Acheckout_read_is_bounded_relative_and_never_follows_links|default: both build the same real checkout, symlink, hardlink and oversized file and assert the same 13 negative names at the same lines. The C=4 path-escape invariant (O_NOFOLLOW read at crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_files.rs:41-60, still_at at crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/delegation_files.rs:178-182) is preserved verbatim in the retained test, so no high-criticality protection is erased.","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr-runtime%3A%3Adelegation_fallback_files|delegation_files%3A%3Aread_tests%3A%3Acheckout_read_is_bounded_relative_and_never_follows_links|default""]",second binary-level execution of the identical body; no sleeps,0.013,0.013,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:2559 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,runtime-delegation-001,independent-runtime-delegation-check-1
