nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Ainitial_prompt|lost_response_reconnect_reconciles_one_exact_launch_and_duplicate_does_not_replay|default,,992a1da5c59a865ebb48051e4d9d8ff7184c8dc5,Test,nextest,ovrcr::initial_prompt,integration,acceptance,lost_response_reconnect_reconciles_one_exact_launch_and_duplicate_does_not_replay,default,tests/initial_prompt.rs,913,1049,"[""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/mod.rs:912-945"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/lifecycle.rs:107-249"", ""crates/ovrcr-runtime/src/server/lifecycle.rs:300-380""]","After submitting without reading the response, the fake CLI received the exact multiline prompt once; a reconnected Dashboard reconciles the intent to LaunchAccepted, a duplicate returns the same snapshot without replay, the remembered launch choice survives, and no prompt bytes reach config/db/events/logs.","A duplicate launch/send after a lost response, or prompt leakage into durable stores.",4,4,4,3,100,95,97,Prompt text is private input and a replay can double-execute paid agent work.,"Exact launch count, exact argv payload count, snapshot equality and byte scans of every durable store.",Lost-response idempotence plus privacy scanning is only evidenced here.,"Real server/socket, real PTY launcher and sqlite; the CLI is a controlled stand-in.",high,keep,"Keep: Exact launch count, exact argv payload count, snapshot equality and byte scans of every durable store. Lost-response idempotence plus privacy scanning is only evidenced here.","[""nextest|Test|ovrcr%3A%3Ainitial_prompt|old_server_lifetime_intent_is_unknown_after_restart_and_never_replays|default""]","[""real server+sqlite""]",3.416,3.416,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:976 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,other-rust-integration-004,independent-integration-mid-check-1
