on.rs:695-903; distinguishing assertion at tests/pi_delegation.rs:434-438.",Compiled ovrcr CLI and a real Dashboard socket drive an isolated server and a real managed Pi child PTY over real files and fixtures; no mock substitutes the subject; real boundary at tests/support/live.rs:226-228.,high,keep,"Broad, precise acceptance coverage of the highest-criticality ownership and capacity invariants; no equivalence argument would allow removing it.",[],"[""real managed child PTY"", ""isolated server process"", ""filesystem polling with 10ms sleeps"", ""cli_json subprocess invocations"", ""50 successful session creations inside one test""]",12.499,12.499,1,0,hosted-single-run,evidence/macos-job.log:1299 (PASS attempt 1); run 42429838269 job 128576086691,public-delegation-001,independent-delegation-check-1
